  ('zcrm_1579374000163846150', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163846155', 'Joseph Coohill', NULL, '4-24-25 Matt is Joe''s brother who is helping Joe bc he just had a major stroke at the age of 62. He had the stroke about April 4th, 2025. He lost his job and literally has no money. He has a 22 year old son who is on his own. Matt is helping Joe move from CA back to CO with the rest of their family. Joe will live in his parents place in Denver while he recovers. However their dad has lymphoma for many years and is 82 and not in a position to take care of Joe. So, they are all doing their best to figure it out. I helped Matt complete the app on C4 to qualify for Medicaid. He will upload the Cobra letter and it shows his coverage ends 4-30-25. Hopefully they''ll hear from Medicaid before his next appt on May 2nd. I will tell them to make sure wherever they go accepts Medicaid. They are going to Anschutz. They are working on applying for short-term disability and he doesn''t qualify for unemployment in CA bc he wasn''t employed a full year to qualify.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-24 18:15:50', '2025-04-24 18:15:50'),
