  ('zcrm_1579374000163830024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115238001', 'Joaquin Quintana', NULL, '4/24/25: Alexandria called very confused about her plan and what they have here. They didn''t really know anything about the health share or MEC and only thought they had an HSA account. They recently added daughter''s to HSA account and one daughter''s appendix ruptured. They are now being hit with some pretty high medical bills. 
