  ('zcrm_1579374000163791001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '4-23-25 Figge called to remember what we had discussed. He just paid $321 +$107 = $428 for May. His next billing will be $299 for Premium Care and $107 for HAB = $406 on May 20th billing for June onward. He just needed clarification since he''s turning 50 and will benefit most from moving to Premium Care with no downside.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-23 12:19:18', '2025-04-23 12:19:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000163781004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010282093', 'Matthew Schaub', NULL, 'Member called after hours asking about why he was charged.  I returned his call and let him know that we have no record of his desire to cancel either in Cognito or in notes.  I advised that I could cancel him eff 4/30/25 and that I could refund the May Share Amount.  He is fine with that I will send out link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-04-23 12:05:15', '2025-04-23 12:05:15'),
