  ('zcrm_1579374000163686042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000075132226', 'Maria Borden', NULL, '4-22-25 Bob called and left vm asking how to create a new Need for an MRI he recently did. I left a detailed message telling him to call MPB Concierge for assistance and let him know of the 6 month time limit from date of service and needs to pay the first $1000 and show proof of doing so.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-22 15:49:18', '2025-04-22 15:49:18'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000163686032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156781406', 'Megan Ila', NULL, '4-22-25 I sent Megan the contact info above to help with her account. They just want to go to the dentist. I told her it''s easiest to simply ask the dentist thay they want to go to whether or not they accept either or the two networks. If both, choose the one with the best discount. They are looking for new dentists so they are open. All set for now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-22 15:43:30', '2025-04-22 15:43:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000163686020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, '4-22-25 Jill called back and I reiterated what I told Eric. Jill understands that she can try the virtual healthcare app when gets sick and if she has to go in person she will pay for the visit, the strep culture or whatever. She''s not thrilled with this idea but she will proceed as is. She also knows she has Redirect until May 31st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-22 15:25:34', '2025-04-22 15:25:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000163686015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, '4-22-25 Jill didn''t answer for our appt. I talked with Eric and he said her concern is simply her sinus infections that she gets a few times a year that she will now have to pay for  when he goes. She''s saving $145 a month or $1740  a year by removing Redirect for her alone. She''s welcome to join that if she wants but it doesn''t really make sense. She will have to call me back.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-22 15:13:27', '2025-04-22 15:13:27'),
