  ('zcrm_1579374000163633008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139466006', 'Lizelle Cline', NULL, '4/22/25: Lori was able to have scripts send over the bills for Lizelle. 
See conversation below:

Good morning Lizelle,

This is the news I received from Lori at ARM yesterday afternoon:

Hi Angee,
I was able to get through to Miranda at Scripps on behalf of Lizelle Cline.  The provider will resubmit claims to ARM’s clearinghouse.
We will not be getting the claim for the Dermatologist so the member will have to pay for that service.
I have asked that the patient not be sent to collections while we wait for the re-billing process to be completed.
All good.

I''m setting a reminder to follow up on these in a week to ensure they''ve been processed. I''ll reach back out early next week with an update.
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-22 07:42:22', '2025-04-22 07:42:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000163634001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135734002', 'Michael Meyers', NULL, 'Member called in and left VM after hours.  After reaching him he told me that he wanted to cancel.  I will send out link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-04-22 07:20:47', '2025-04-22 07:20:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000163633001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156834039', 'Andrew Thomsen', NULL, 'Michelle called with a few issues. She needs help getting into her member portal, said pw isn''t working and reset isn''t working. It did finally work with password listed on account. 
She asked about going to urgent care, and if she just goes and presents as self pay. yes
She wants to see someone for tightness in chest, and get a chest xray or something. I mentioned that we can help with finding fair prices for imaging - and did a quick search for chest xray, which she can schedule near her for about $35 for 1 view. She''s going to check out the site. 
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-22 07:17:20', '2025-04-22 07:17:20'),
