  ('zcrm_1579374000163607081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149295021', 'Lara Radojcic Llosa', NULL, '4/21/2025
Member Lara called, expressing frustration regarding an upcoming breast MRI, which she stated would cost approximately $1,000. I informed her that if the cost does not exceed her IUA, it may not be eligible for a sharing request. Lara later mentioned she had already paid out of pocket for a mammogram she believed to be preventative. I advised her to seek reimbursement from ARM, as preventative services are typically covered at 100%.

Lara then noted that her provider had reached out to us for coverage clarification. I explained that the provider did contact us and indicated that the mammogram was diagnostic rather than preventative. I attempted to clarify the distinction, but Lara became upset and disconnected the call. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-21 18:07:16', '2025-04-21 18:07:16'),
