  ('zcrm_1579374000163519040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000050050205', 'Eric Cohen', NULL, '4-18-25 Jill was upset that only Eric receives the email notifications about the rate changes and membership changes and my email was getting bounced back. So, she was not pleased. Once I explained why all of that happens and she got Eric onto the line, she understood. I explained the new price for 2 months. I explained what Redirect includes and HAB includes. I explained that they will lose in person PCP and chiro but gain all of the rest of HAB benefits and get their total price back down to where it was. They were paying $732.28 for PDHC and it went to $808 for April and May. Then moving to Premium Care automatically for May 20th billing for June at $532 MS / $1500 IUA + $200 ES for HAB = $732!  For one month they pay overlapping $200 for HAB and still have Redirect. But, she can use the PCP for that month. They will save $60 per month vs getting Redirect separately for $260.  They save $720 by dropping Redirect and adding HAB. They are happy now and all set moving forward with billing and timing. Eric''s address is still wrong on payment receipt showing 133 Lewies Circle and it should be 113 Lewies Circle. It''s correct in Admin123 and Zoho. So, I told him let''s just leave it alone. That''s not where anything gets mailed from. He was fine with that since he''s asked at least 5 times already to get it fixed. MPB continues to tell him it''s fixed when it''s not.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-18 16:02:00', '2025-04-18 16:02:00'),
