  ('zcrm_1579374000163406097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163494009', 'Katherine Totten', NULL, '4-17-25 Kate is 63 and just got released from her job with Douglas County. Cobra will be $1000+ a month for just her! She''s healthy with the exception of a pinched nerve in her neck. She visited a surgeon and got a clean bill of health! She rides bikes and does outdoor activities. She''s going to do a spin class tomorrow morning. She has a membership with Chuze Fitness, yes for wellness, dental, vision, mental health and no for nutrition. No tobacco. She''s listing her house right now in Highlands Ranch but will still live in CO. She watched the video on her own and we discussed the pre-x clause. I will need to share the 36 months and send her Premium Care to review. Already sent her HAB brochure to review before we talk tomorrow. Quoted $1000/$299 + $107 HAB = $406 and need to mention $125.  Update - I sent her the overview which discusses the additional fees. Just make sure we review the pre-x clause which will also be on the application.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-17 14:18:11', '2025-04-17 14:21:06'),
