  ('zcrm_1579374000163406048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163424002', 'Kendra Campbell', NULL, '4-17-25 Kendra decided to join Care+ and HAB after much deliberation. She was getting chiro through Freedom Life at no cost. When I asked her the cash price she said it''s only about $35-$40 per session which is incredible. She will use the thermogram, colonoscopy after 6 month wait, yoga class, labs, maybe skin check. She just did her thermo, dental cleaning and vision recently which is a bummer. But, she will pay a little more per month and get a lot more in return. She will join Middleway Wellness, so I had her enroll through that link. She joined HAB for $124 and will get $70 reimbursed. She chose CARE+ $2500/$300. See full numbers in above notes. She had to wrap her head around acupuncture and chiro is not considered wellness with HAB and only allowed with CARE+ when it''s a new accident, injury or illness. Once she understood this she finally decided to move forward even though it''s not what she was hoping. She does all of her care via alternative Drs. She''s all set for May 1st start date and knows the billing dates, etc. She will cancel Freedom Life next.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-17 12:48:06', '2025-04-17 12:48:06'),
