  ('zcrm_1579374000163406038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044810847', 'Sally Hammond', NULL, '4-17-25 Sally''s mammogram still hasn''t been paid by Redirect.  But the bill was originally $521 and she asked her provider why it was $521 and not the same $200 as it was every other year. They responded and said they made a mistake. So, now the bill is $200+ and she''ll send me proof which I''ll forward to Redirect. She also shared that she got a bill from a provider a year later bc the provider''s billing system had been down for one year!  I told her to try to submit it to Sedera and let them know what happened to see if they''d reimburse her. They did!  They were totally reasonable and shared in that cost. She was thrilled!  She''s now equally as happy with HAB. They reimburse her within days or even hours. It''s been an incredibly positive experience. Now we just have to get Redirect to do their part once and for all.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-17 11:48:06', '2025-04-17 11:48:06'),
