  ('zcrm_1579374000163360092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, '4-16-25 Emily is enrolling in HAB EO $107 for May 1st. She''s leaving tomorrow to go to Iceland with Gretchen Reeves and her husband. They got married in Oct and they are all celebrating together. Emily chose to drop Redirect since she''s not using it but is very excited about HAB.  Completed the Change Form. I sent her the brochure to help her know what''s included and how to submit for reimbursement. She''s all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-16 13:39:03', '2025-04-16 13:39:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000163344188', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120206002', 'Nick Jones', NULL, '4/16/25
