  ('zcrm_1579374000163340117', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044406145', 'Casey Richter', NULL, 'Casey emailed me and asked about options nor that "Redirect no longer exists".  I assured her that she could continue on w/ Redirect on her own.  I gave her what she will be paying on the SD membership ($263) and the option to re-enroll w/Redirect.  I refreshed her memory as to what Sedera was for and what Redirect handled.  She asked about Preventative coverage I told her about the HSA memberships.  She will contact Wendy about this.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-04-16 13:32:46', '2025-04-16 13:32:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000163360087', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044061129', 'Emily Kloser', NULL, '4-15-25 Emily was in the middle of a hut trip party she was hosting with Vail Valley Foundation. She wants to add HAB and drop Redirect. She hasn''t used any of it bc she didn''t know how to use it.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-16 13:30:30', '2025-04-16 13:30:30'),
