  ('zcrm_1579374000163360082', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027674121', 'WAHEED AYUBI', NULL, '4-16-25 Waheed called me bc he received notification that his membership is ending with Sedera. He asked me ton of questions about what his options are, cost of the MEC and how to keep compliant in CA. Per his questioning, I let him know he can keep his MEC and join SECURE HSA. He had already looked at Covered CA and it would be $1500 a month EC and he didn''t want it. So, after making sure he understands new pre-x clause and to make sure his current Need for son is closed out, he is happy with Secure HSA $1000/$578 for May 1st start date.  He knows he has 30 days to submit final bills for any open needs. Sounds like sons need will never reach $1000 IUA anyhow and it''s not ongoing. He knows anything related to that will be his cost. Nobody else has any pre-x. He cancelled his PSDHC for April 30th. He''s all set. He had trouble with CirrusMD on his phone but got it to work on his computer. His phone shows up as locked or I forget the word he used. But, he''s fine with using his computer instead anyhow. He knows to set up the Welcome Call and save the Quick Ref Guide. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-16 13:17:52', '2025-04-16 13:17:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000163360077', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164537001', 'Brooke LeClaire', NULL, '4-16-25 We tried to complete the Tax Time Enrollment process. Her accountant checked the box to indicate she qualifies. She submitted her taxes yesterday and when we pushed it through on C4 it wouldn''t allow us to proceed stating no SEP. We called C4 and spoke with Stephanie and she said Brooke has to wait now until she gets a letter in the mail from the IRS showing her SEP and has 60 days from that time to choose her plan. She will get about an $800+ APTC with her income at $23,500 as her best guess for 2025 w/ self employment biz. So, we wait again. Her Ref # for the call is CAS311237C6W0D4. Brooke will text me when she gets the letter and we will proceed. If we get blocked for the enrollment Stephanie said to call C4 and they will help unlock the account to proceed.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-16 12:28:33', '2025-04-16 12:28:33');
