  ('zcrm_1579374000163336084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154439020', 'Carlos Weaver', NULL, '4/16/25: Erika called wanting to confirm that her plan is HSA eligible. I explained that it was and why. We also discussed how to update payment information - guided her to form on website. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-16 12:04:06', '2025-04-16 12:04:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000163336079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000058356826', 'Jennifer Woomer', NULL, '4/16/25: Jennifer called and brought a provider into the phone regarding her upcoming prev mamm appt. The provider let me know they had already checked and not in network. I explained the vendor change and how unfortunately, to get the mamm covered at 100%, Jennifer would need to do it at an in-network facility. I suggested she cancel her appt and let us help schedule her an appt. Sent her an email of available options and schedule appt link. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-16 12:03:13', '2025-04-16 12:03:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000163336070', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000028471248', 'Charles Christian Figge VI', NULL, '4/16/25: Spoke to Figge about psychiatry options. The person he saw previously was around $160 per visit and he saw him quarterly. Unfortunately the dr retired, so he needs to find another option. We discussed the. psychiatry benefit through MEC health wallet and I also offered to do a more thorough search to find best price option for him. Emailed links for app and schedule an appt form, as well as a summary of our conversation since he seemed a little confused about the options. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-16 11:56:17', '2025-04-16 11:56:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000163360049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163360057', 'Deborah Ares', NULL, '4-16-25 Deborah just turned 62 yesterday. She ended her massage and skin care business. She got hired on with Andrea''s Angels and earns about $325 per week = $16,900 and $550 per month for rental property after expenses = $6,600 = $23,500 total. She''s getting a bigger APTC and kept her plan.  Her previous broker ghosted her, so she did it on her own and was a bit confused. It showed that he has Cobra which she doesn''t.  

