  ('zcrm_1579374000163360031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163846068', 'Mark Reinhard', NULL, '4-15-25 Mark was just hired as THIA as their new COO and making $150K. Lives in Perrysburg, OH but with THIA! His only pre-x is high blood pressure and takes the lowest dose to keep down. No other problems and very well managed. No hospitalizations. He was hired on April 3rd which gives him a June 1st start date for MCS and July 1st for life ins. He can stay on his wife''s ins for now. He''s looking at EO $419/$1000 or EF $1018/$1000. He wants dental pricing as well. 

