  ('zcrm_1579374000163176068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129378061', 'California Bonham', NULL, '4-14-25 Cali lost her self-employment job with ... Le Castle. I helped talk her through changing her income to $0 and she lost the income last month. She''s within the 60 days. I called her back to see if she had a letter to show proof of end of self-employment. But, it was all on the phone and with personal contacts and no written contract. However the person who hired her was fired from her role as CEO and therefore was no longer able to hire Cali for the work she''s doing. So, there''s nothing to present to C4 or Medicaid at this point. She wanted to notify Cigna to lower her APTC but we really just have to wait for Medicaid''s response. Otherwise, it will mess up the process of getting accepting to Medicaid. So we have to wait and hope she gets an answer before her next payment on April 30th.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-14 17:05:53', '2025-04-14 17:05:53'),
