  ('zcrm_1579374000163048099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144055012', 'Kate Wasserman', NULL, '4/11/25: Kate emailed asking the following questions:
1.	I''d like to know if there''s a fee on using a credit card to pay for my monthly premium? Yes, there is a 3% surcharge
2.	New Card - I use this for preventive services only? Yes, this is your preventive MEC (Minimum Essential Coverage) and pays for preventive services as outlined I the ACA Guidelines. https://www.healthcare.gov/coverage/preventive-care-benefits/
3.	Sharing into egg freezing and storage – I spoke to Zion regarding this and they stated that this typically falls into the “fertility section” of their guidelines and is usually not shareable, however, since medical issues can vary so much on a case by case basis, you can always submit your issue as a sharing request to receive a solid determination regarding your particular case. 
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-11 11:51:19', '2025-04-11 11:51:19'),
