  ('zcrm_1579374000162970074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153327002', 'Rachel Klobucher', NULL, '4/10/25: Rachel called and we discussed in detail her prescription options and the mail order option through Health Wallet. While there are instructions on how to order, we''re unsure about how she can switch from Amazon to this -Advanced Pharmacy to access her Estradiol. I need to figure out if price listed on formulary is for 3 or what the cost would be for 30 and 90 day supply, how to switch from amazon to them, does she have to use mail order to access future discounts for progesterone? 
