AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-10 08:55:55', '2025-04-10 08:56:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000162970061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129589002', 'Eileen Sanders Mendez', NULL, '4/10/25: Called Eileen to check and see if she was able to make an appt and how it went. She said actually, she''s been having the hardest time - that the providers she calls are on PHCS, but don''t know what that is when she calls and would really like help getting an appt. I emailed her appt scheduling form. We also discussed maternity requests through Zion - she was worried bc of how hard it is right now to find OBGYN. Let her know it''d be a lot simpler bc there is no network and gave a brief overview of how it would work. Emailed maternity guidelines as well. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-10 08:40:31', '2025-04-10 08:40:31'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000162944072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011881333', 'Kaleb Kurz', NULL, 'Kaleb was forwarded to me by Patti once we saw he forgot to pay his bill and membership got cancelled. Noticed i could save him money so we switched him to ZIon instead of re enrolling with Sedera. Signed him up with Secure HSA MF $1,000 IUA
