  ('zcrm_1579374000162970051', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', NULL, '4/10/25: Called Whitney to go over recent lab bill. Unfortunately, since it is diagnostic, the MEC isn''t going to pay anything towards it. Also explained that I looked up these labs through our discount sites and the prices were in line or less than what he would pay through them. I suggested to see if Quest would offer cash rate, but it''s still a gamble bc the adjusted prices may be better than paying cash. Also let him know that if this is still an issue for his son, the bill can go towards his IUA. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-10 08:10:24', '2025-04-10 08:10:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000162972004', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610208', 'Marc Krawatsky', NULL, 'Marc let me know he tried to use Advanced Pharmacy, ARMs mail-order pharmacy, and it was not allowing him to order as they need to be ordered by a doctor and he was not prescribed these as they are OTC. We didn''t have time to further discuss this as he had to get off the phone.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2025-04-10 08:06:27', '2025-04-10 08:06:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000162929134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133732002', 'Megan Keyser', 'research on psychiatrist', '### ? **Therapy Provider Rate Summary**

1. **Grace Akopyan, LMFT – Therapy with Grace**  
   - **Rate**: $200 per 50-minute session  
   - **Type**: Licensed Marriage & Family Therapist  
   - **Website**: [therapywithgrace.net](https://www.therapywithgrace.net/plans-pricing-services)

2. **Mindpath Health**  
   - **Initial Consultation**: $500–$600  
   - **Follow-Up Sessions**: $350–$500  
   - **Type**: Likely psychiatric or combined therapy/medication services  

3. **Rising Sun Mental Health**  
   - **Initial Consultation (60–90 min)**: $525  
   - **Follow-Up (25 min)**: $295  
   - **Extended Follow-Up (50 min)**: $395  
   - **Website**: [risingsunmentalhealth.com](https://risingsunmentalhealth.com/#page-3)', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-10 08:03:57', '2025-04-10 10:36:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000162970037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109512002', 'Gabrian McPhail', NULL, '4/10/25: Kait stated that she reprocessed the bill and is sending provider check, but did not elaborate on whether the bill was paid in full. Called to let Gabe know that it was reprocessed- Left very detailed message. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-10 08:02:25', '2025-04-10 08:02:53'),
