  ('zcrm_1579374000162734006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044118411', 'Nathalie Joly', NULL, '4-7-25 Nathalie called bc Daniel needs neuro surgery for new spacers in neck for C5 and C7 or something close to that. She''s quoted $90K with a 25% discount already. Sedera/Savvos is saying the surgery should range from $25K-$30K! Sedera is allowing for $50K max. I suggested the following:
1) Ask hospital and Dr. if they can do the surgery for $50K max.
2) Call MPB Concierge Team for highest quality care at best price.
3) I recommended to look at Dr. Lee Nelson in Boulder purely from dad''s experience with same type of surgery.
4) Create account with Savvos system to see what they are recommending as well. 
She''s open to going somewhere else, if necessary. They clearly can''t pay $40K which is the difference in price they are facing!
5) Finally the quote looks like it might be only for one spacer, not two. That might change the financial equation to bring up the cost for two.
6) I also told her to speak with her Needs coordinator for assistance as well.
She will keep me posted.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-07 12:18:55', '2025-04-07 12:23:02'),
