  ('zcrm_1579374000162701059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000112454010', 'Sheila Jones', NULL, '4/7/25: Sheila called and it seemed like she thought that Zion had no record or notes on her.  I brought Zion into the phone call to see what''s going on. Zion reached out to her 4/3 and requested documents. Sheila said she uploaded docs to MPB Health but not Zion member portal. Apparently she wasn''t even in Zion portal all this time. We got her onto member portal and gave instructions on how to upload documents. Sheila was able to access and upload documents. 
