  ('zcrm_1579374000162701054', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109501001', 'Sophia Guzman', NULL, '4/7/25: Sophia called, she has a stress fracture and needs info on how to opening need. We discussed how the process works and how the concierge can help with finding providers and providing quotes on imaging etc. We discussed physical therapy limitations and paying IUA. The fact that IUAs are issue specific. Sophia also asked about the amount she''s paid into insurance - offered to send 1095. Requested via teams. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-07 09:46:09', '2025-04-07 09:46:09'),
