  ('zcrm_1579374000162701035', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139466006', 'Lizelle Cline', NULL, '4/7/25: Called ARM to see if they had any claims on file for Lizelle. Monica stated that they only had RX claim on file which means the provider never sent there. She had ARM starting in September which should pay for the bills that Lizelle is getting as long as they are preventive.

