  ('zcrm_1579374000162632018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059725045', 'Michelle Skellion', NULL, '4-4-25 Michelle called to get breakdown of hers and kids portion. Secure HSA is $419 for 50-65 and $733 for EC, therefore kids cost is $314 per month. This way she can share the cost with her x to get paid. Price changed from $650 to $733 on Dec. 20th, 2024 for Jan. membership onward.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-04 16:22:56', '2025-04-04 16:22:56'),
