  ('zcrm_1579374000162609086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153327002', 'Rachel Klobucher', NULL, '04/04/2025
Rachel called in wanting to know how things have changed with RX benefits. I let her know to just put through a quote request and we can shop around for her and even look through the new formularies and options for tier 1 & 2 medications. She also asked what the procedure for dermatology is and if that was preventative. She got a bill for the dermatologist office visit and did not know if it was shareable. I let her know that it is not and the only type of dermatology that is preventative is a visual scan by your primary during a preventative visit. Going to the dermatologist is a specialist so it is not shared upon. 
AJ', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2025-04-04 12:21:24', '2025-04-04 12:21:24'),
