  ('zcrm_1579374000162608071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000052659223', 'James Julian', NULL, 'After speaking w/Adam (see note below) Member has submitted change form to lower IUA to $5000 eff 5/25. I will process &amp; notify Sedera', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-04-04 12:13:13', '2025-04-04 12:13:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000162608066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128689002', 'Laura Kirkpatrick', NULL, 'Member called in asking about the price increase and reasoning behind it.  Says she was unaware that there would be a price increase when she enrolled.  I told her that the group renewed in June so that will be when there is a price increase  each year', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-04-04 11:57:38', '2025-04-04 11:57:38'),
