  ('zcrm_1579374000162608061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000039830025', 'Julie Gibson-Clark', NULL, 'Member called in with questions about her Redirect membership ending.  She also asked about adding her son for a couple of months.  I advised her to look into Short Term Medical', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-04-04 11:50:01', '2025-04-04 11:50:01'),
