  ('zcrm_1579374000162610132', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442360', 'Whitney Hammond', NULL, '4/4/25: Whitney called wanting to know if there was an update on why the shingles vaccine was pulling up as so much. Acelyn said she''s still waiting for an update from Ana from ARM. I mentioned to Whitney that the pharmacy benefit did change - and it''s possible if he was using old card that it didn''t work bc it''s not valid anymore. I emailed him a screenshot of the new pharmacy info and suggested he try it since he''s in costco right now, and in the meantime, we''ll touch base with ARM to see if they found out anything. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-04 11:37:42', '2025-04-04 11:37:42'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000162611123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161261009', 'Jeffrey Nilges', NULL, 'Welcome call with Jeff and Katherine. Put in request to Kelly to send out welcome packet. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-04 10:57:48', '2025-04-04 10:57:48'),
