Stepahine called and wanted to know what was going on with the email we sent her in regard to switching over the self-directed members over to premium care. She saw her monthly cost go up this passed month and wanted to know if the email we sent was us adding that amount to her monthly payment or if that was what the monthly payment would now become. I told her the email with the prices for Premium care would be the amount she would now be paying. She understood. Afterwards she wanted to see how to raise her IUA level so she could get more savings monthly. I showed her how to submit the change form and we did that together on the phone. I let her know that this would make her responsible for the first $5,000 on any need that may arise in the future so she would be financially liable for that amount in the future. She also wanted to make sure this would not affect on open need she currently has open with her son. I spoke with Patti and she confirmed that they would be fine with the open need.', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2025-04-04 10:02:09', '2025-04-04 10:02:09'),
