  ('zcrm_1579374000162506001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130307002', 'Amanda McKannon', NULL, 'Stefan called because he noticed that his price was different from last year.  I checked in the price and it was correct for Secure membership.  He was referencing the difference from the Co-Pay.  I advised that that membership had been discontinued and went over the differences between that and the Copay.  Member has a chronic condition and  Co-pay would end up costing him less.  I directed him to be in touch with Steve Remmel to see what he had available for him.  He also asked about cards.  I offered to have a digital card sent to him.  He said that he has never received that the previous times it was sent to him.  Kelly advises that it was sent to the email on file 3 times.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-04-02 12:21:15', '2025-04-02 12:21:15'),
