  ('zcrm_1579374000162418001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124631253', 'Ilysa Keeley', NULL, '4/1/25
Ilysa is going through menopause and is having may symptoms that she is trying to take care. Her menopause sharing request is on hold because zion will not move forward because of the eye practice but her eyes are not her main concern she just wants to move forward with her sharing request. After speaking with cheela form zion she escalated the issue to adjust the sharing request to be regarding menopause and not an eye problem. The will also send her a link to file a complain on the eye practice for not giving her the medical record for having a balance on a bill she paid in full AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-01 13:08:56', '2025-04-01 13:08:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000162417001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044575094', 'Doug Klof', NULL, '4-1-25 Doug re-enrolled in Premium Care for 5-1-25 start date! He''s all set and knows of the small price increase from $474 to $497/$1500 IUA for May 20th billing for June. He''s thrilled to get this going again for him and 4 kids.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-01 13:07:56', '2025-04-01 13:07:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000162416001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000142870002', 'Valerie Mars', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 5/25 due to member aging into Medicare 5/1/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-04-01 13:06:48', '2025-04-01 13:06:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000162365084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162402001', 'Ariel Tidwell', NULL, '4-1-25 Ariel came to me via Robert and Cindy Glowczewsky. Ariel is 46 and Ernest is turning 51 next week and 3 kids 15, 12, 9. Kids are healthy, just broken bones from sports. Live in Gunnison, CO. Husband changed jobs recently and they don''t have any insurance at the moment. May 1st start date. Ernest had a small back procedure that cost $2K called RFA which burned nerve endings and they will grow back. I forewarned her about the pre-x clause and anything related to that back issue. She knows they are saving a bunch of money with MCS vs ins, so she''s fine with paying for that if need be. She will make sure with her husband as well. They take some supplements, so they can benefit for discounts. Ariel has asthma and uses inhaler. She also has hypothyroid and takes Synthroid. Takes paxel for anxiety. No other issues. She''s thrilled for the monthly amount compared to what they are used to with the high ded and mop. Chose to join Premium Care $1000/$837 and knows it will be $877 June onward. She is due for a mammo and I told her the $600 cap and 6 month wait. She doesn''t do the rest of the wellness stuff. I also told her about colonoscopy cap of $2500.  They are all set for May 1st start date!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-01 12:53:52', '2025-04-01 12:53:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000162361031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120816002', 'Michael Lam', NULL, '4/1/25
