Called after her welcome call due to a few things not working properly, health wallet could not find her in the system, and when trying to open Zion portal it prompts her to register and pay for membership, She also would like anything mailed to her or sent to her in regards to the QR records vault. I got her info and will look into these problems then reach back out to her.   AJ', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2025-04-01 12:11:45', '2025-04-02 08:43:57'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000162345220', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156917016', 'Mary Kay Schneider', NULL, '4/1/25: Mary called to gain clarity on the list of mamm prices and places she can go. We went over how the prices are calculated and what to expect when calling some of these places. I also showed her radiology assist, which came up with better price options for her mamm. We also discussed urgent care needs and what to do if she has something come up - presenting as cash pay and using cirrus md. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-01 12:06:58', '2025-04-01 12:06:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000162348118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000009604129', 'Lori Frisbie', NULL, 'Member called in asking about Aging into Medicare and cancelling.  I advised her that the 1st email was sent out to her on 3/5 which she found.  She to call back with any further questions', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-04-01 12:03:30', '2025-04-01 12:03:30');
