  ('zcrm_1579374000162345160', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061522143', 'Steve Remmel', NULL, '4/1/25: Steve called. He received a notice of a denied bill from planstin and with it an appeal from provider. It was for a mamm his wife got on July 26th. Planstin showed the bill being received 3/19/25. As he read all this out, Steve realized that the provider sent the bill late and that was the issue. I agreed and made sure he knew that this would fall on provider if the appeal didn''t go through. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-01 11:30:37', '2025-04-01 11:30:37'),
