  ('zcrm_1579374000162345125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115748002', 'Charles Chase', NULL, '4/1/25: Charles called regarding the fact that his cards only have his name on it. I let him know that it is normal and has been like that for a very long time. His wife finds it very annoying and requested I put a bug in someone''s ear. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-01 10:26:35', '2025-04-01 10:26:35'),
