  ('zcrm_1579374000162345120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124507245', 'Aimee Fisher', NULL, '4/1/25: Aimee called back saying that Zion is requiring her to add twins before the remainder of her hospital delivery stay will be paid. Asked if she''d give me a day to look into this, because it doesn''t seem right according to their guidelines. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-01 10:13:02', '2025-04-01 10:13:02'),
