  ('zcrm_1579374000162345115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085146002', 'Rebecca Snyder', NULL, '4/1/25: Rebecca Snyder called letting us know that she also received a “Paul Snyder’s” card in the mail.  I instructed her to just cut and trash the one for Paul and sent Dave from ARM and email alerting him of the mixup, requesting he make sure Paul was sent his as well. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-01 09:24:55', '2025-04-01 09:24:55'),
