  ('zcrm_1579374000162345089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152900007', 'Joanne Gomez-Arnold', NULL, '4/1/25: Called to Fu with Joanne regarding a list of therapists available through new ARM benefit. According to the EAP, Joanne can call them and they can put together a personalized list for her. Gave Joanne number and let her know she can also access this through new HealthWallet app. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-04-01 09:06:12', '2025-04-01 09:06:12'),
