  ('zcrm_1579374000162365001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144154242', 'Brenda Brueske Kolve', NULL, '4-1-25 Brenda and I reviewed HAB to make sure it was worth her money. She has labs, dental, possible gym that she can already get reimbursed for in 2025. She''s considering mammo and inquired about colonoscopy but might prefer the less invasive options for her husband. They will also do a skin check. She decided to keep it. All set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-04-01 08:45:13', '2025-04-01 08:45:13'),
