  ('zcrm_1579374000162234029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138597002', 'Bladimir Aviles', NULL, '3-31-25 Bladimir called again asking what to do since he''s talked with 3 accountants who won''t do his taxes without the 1095 form. I told him again to tell them he doesn''t have one. He did not get a tax credit from the gov for his healthcare solution and did not go through the exchange. Therefore he does not have a tax form. His savings outweigh any adjustment he''ll have on his taxes, per my previous calculations. He did not have any ins of any kind until he joined Ironwood Mkting Concepts either. So, no form for the rest of the year either.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-31 11:38:51', '2025-03-31 11:38:51'),
