  ('zcrm_1579374000162227071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124631253', 'Ilysa Keeley', NULL, '3/31/25: Illysa called with concerns about her recent dr visit. She has a really low blood count and they recommended she get a colo and see a hematologist. I let her know that it sounds like this would be a diagnostic colo instead of preventive and to clarify with her dr on how she ordered it. As for the low blood count, if she''s expecting this situation to turn into a lot of expenses, then yes - go ahead and open a sharing request. I wasn''t sure how to advise her on naming the request without an official diagnosis yet and connected with Zion for additional help. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-31 09:27:16', '2025-03-31 09:27:16'),
