  ('zcrm_1579374000161981042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044781197', 'Daniel Siegrist', NULL, '3-26-25 Dan added one more employee to his group, Kristi Ross. We decided together that it''s best to leave the billing as-is. It''s more work and complication than necessary to move it to a List Bill group. If he adds another employee, we can change it at that time.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-26 22:54:26', '2025-03-26 22:54:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161981037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000162067003', 'Andrew Somps', NULL, '3-26-25 Andrew called and wants to enroll tomorrow in Premium Care $1500 IUA / $741 April 20th billing then $777 May 20th billing for June. They want the no waiting period for maternity and it''s 2x the IUA. They might add wellness later. He mentioned his wife might need psychiatrist visit. I will remind him of HAB for mental health and can possibly just have her join for now. We will talk tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-26 21:34:54', '2025-03-26 21:34:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161981032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161981012', 'Jonna Graulich', NULL, '3-26-25 Jonna was referred to me by Jenna Sezionale with Rooted Expansion. She''s 52, lives in Denver and just lost her job. She looked at ACA which is $550 per month for terrible plans. She takes hormones and works with a naturopath. She''s super healthy, no tobacco, takes supplements, etc. We discussed Premium Care $1000/$299, $1500/$267, $2500/$246 and HAB $107 to give her the best membership for her age and for wellness with her own naturopath. She''s comparing this with Knew Health and says the prices are comparable. Knew Health is doing a 25% discount f or 6 months if she starts April 1st. The will need a mammogram and follow up ultrasound or MRI. She will use pap screening, skin check, dental, gym, maybe mental health and nutrition, not sure about eyes. She gets her labs done through a program called Function Health 2x per year. I''ll send her Premium Care info next. She will review everything and make a decision.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-26 17:54:30', '2025-03-26 17:54:30'),
