  ('zcrm_1579374000161777268', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163360001', 'Blythe Burge', NULL, '3-21-25 From Buffy "Hi Wendy,
I got your contact information from Amos Shuman in Asheville, NC.  We (family of 5) live near Asheville, NC also.  I am wanting to ask you the differences in the Secure HSA vs. Premium HSA.  Can you please give me a call at your convenience.  I will be at a meeting from 9:30am- 10:45am EST, Friday.  Otherwise, I am available any other time up to 8:30PM EST.  My phone is (828)215-2147. 
