  ('zcrm_1579374000161676523', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161676496', 'McKenzie Mann', NULL, '3-20-25 He called back once he had service again. I explained the pre-x clause for both Premium Care and Care+. He prefers alternative care! He also wants dental. I explained HAB to help with alternative care needs but he might not use enough if it to make it worthwhile. He would use dental, gym and does own blood work. That''s about it. We''ll skip that part. Now, he''s trying to decide which is better Care+ or Premium Care. The prices are close but Premium Care has better pre-x moving forward but less leniency with alt care. He should be outside of all pre-x clauses except for his preventive chiro visits that he''s done for many years, long before car accident. Uses it for general wellness. He also wanted dental but Dr. Bergan is not in any network, not even the 1Dental networks. She''s with Mindful Dentistry. So, he chose Spirit Dental with out of network benefits for $39.79.

