  ('zcrm_1579374000161676478', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161676452', 'Kristi Ross', NULL, '3-20-25 Kristi is 55 and husband 57, son 22. Eldest son is on own insurance plan.  Kristi is part of the Abacus group led my Dan Siegrist. Kristi is the 3 employee to join. But, today is the deadline so we didn''t have time to set up a group. I told Dan we can set up a group to have it billed via List Bill if he wants. Although, it may not be worth the time and effort. I''ll run it by him. 
Kristi and family used to use LHS in the past but cancelled around 2019 bc son was going to CU and CU wouldn''t accept it. They went back to trad ins. But, now son is out of CU and she prefers to get back to MCS. Youngest is now 22. Her husband''s job continue to change. With current job it will cost them $1400 for the base/worst plan. They also have an accident policy and whole life policy. Kristi pays cash for her annual bloodwork for her wellness of choice. She uses naturopathic, holistic drs. She has hypotyroid and manages it with healthy diet and exercise.  Her son is on the ski patrol at Eldo and gets his pass for free. Otherwise, they do their exercises without paying $. She has a skin check coming up next month, dental cleanings, vision sometimes, nutrition yes at Be Well Clinic in Loveland, thermogram preferable, cologaurd someday. Might be worth the money for her at the minimum to join HAB. She will review it and run the numbers.
