  ('zcrm_1579374000161675106', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157983003', 'Remy Godwin', NULL, '3/20/25: Appointment Scheduled for HCA Florida, Pine Forest, 7458 Pine Forest Rd, Pensacola, FL 32526 with Dr. Christopher Rush. June 23rd at 9am. Patient needs to arrive 30 minutes prior to appt to complete new patient paperwork. He needs to bring his insurance card, ID, and medication bottles if he''s taking anything. This office does not prescribe controlled medication. They will call a few days ahead of time as a reminder. He''s welcome to call and check back for any cancellations for a sooner appointment. 
