  ('zcrm_1579374000161542114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001172005', 'Kate Paulin', NULL, '3/19/25: Called Kate back and confirmed that we did indeed get and process the request to add her husband to plan. She also asked about cards. I let her know that new MEC cards are getting mailed in April and I''ll put in a request for him to receive an MPB card as well. We verified address. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-19 11:11:41', '2025-03-19 11:11:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161593014', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161633002', 'Daniel Tomkinson', NULL, '3-19-25 Daniel is ready to enroll. He will join Premium Care $285/$1000 EO today and possibly add HAB at a later date. He had to hop off for a meeting. He will call me when he has about 15 min and I''ll walk him through the app for an April 1st start date.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-19 10:54:37', '2025-03-19 13:20:30'),
