  ('zcrm_1579374000161542104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127062001', 'Benjamin Madden', NULL, '3/19/25: Called to FU with Lindsay regarding sharing request. We connected but then call dropped. Sent email and closing task. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-19 10:32:09', '2025-03-19 10:32:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161542096', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129286002', 'Axel Korn', NULL, '3/19/25: Therapy office called to confirm Lisa''s mental health benefits. I explained how her benefits were structured with MSEAP and that the provider would have to be part of their network, otherwise, Lisa would be responsible for payment. They are going to call M&amp;SEAP to see what they can do. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-19 10:28:26', '2025-03-19 10:28:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161542091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005173089', 'Diane Forsberg', NULL, '3/19/25: Diane called stating she hasn''t received physical ARM card yet. I let her know that ARM paused printing in late Feb due to plan changes and she will be getting a new physical card April 1 (or close to it). AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-19 10:14:52', '2025-03-19 10:14:52'),
