  ('zcrm_1579374000161586015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157410002', 'Alison Krupnik', NULL, '03.19.25 - It does not seem like anyone from the team had spoken with Ali, according to the order she attached in her imaging request, it is a straightforward 3d mammogram. Sent her an email as an explanation, and that a ultrasound with dye may not be covered. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-03-19 09:59:00', '2025-03-19 09:59:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161593006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161588012', 'Stephanie PageWise', NULL, '3-19-25 Stephanie enrolled in Care+ $352/$1000 and HAB $107. I sent her the wrong HAB link. I just realized it and sent HAB an email to see how to correct it to w/ DPC. She''s a member of Dr. Mary Ellen Franscecani''s Middleway Wellness DPC. I called and let her know my mistake. Now we will wait for HAB''s response. Mary Ellen''s custom site had many issues as well. I submitted a ticket for all of them to be fixed. Hopefully it will be connected to me and Mary Ellen properly. No confirmation email was sent either.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-19 09:48:24', '2025-03-19 09:48:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161593001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140549002', 'Patricia Nilsen', NULL, '3-19-24 Patty was struggling with MSEAP. She was offered two people to choose from for therapists. She understands that part. Then I explained HAB and she will use that in order to keep her therapist and submit for reimbursement. She recognizes that is super generous to get up to $3K. She already knows how to do reimbursement process bc of the gym portion of the membership. She''s all set for now!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-19 09:41:21', '2025-03-19 09:41:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161542062', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000086124001', 'Cyndi Freeman', NULL, '3/19/25: Cyndi called to confirm preventive start date with Zion. We did a 3 way with Zion which did not go well. After 20 minutes of Callie speaking to their admin team and planstin - they were all in agreement that Cyndi''s prev benefits didn''t begin till 1/1/25 even though it clearly states in records - prev start date was 11/1/22. 
According to Vinnie: a meeting took place on Monday to discuss Cindy Freeman and Clay Leder, I''ve prepped Catherine for a call with Nathan and Derrick to get this fixed... Planstins IT team confirmed the info we had given them is true and should be fixed, the hold up is their boses, so we''re working on that now.  
Setting a reminder to update Cyndi in a few days. 
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-19 09:22:58', '2025-03-19 09:22:58'),
