  ('zcrm_1579374000161417234', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060442195', 'Kristin Smith', NULL, '3-18-25 Kristin is going to leave her job at the end of June and wants a July 1st start date. She moved from Tabernash, CO to Hayward, WI.  She likes to do her preventive screenings. She was just paying for them on her own before with Care+ but loves the idea of HAB. She prefers to do her mammo every year and has dense breasts. So, the follow up MRI will be helpful. She teaches classes at a gym and gets unlimited usage of the gym. But, she does do running races and such which she can get reimbursed for. She also works for an ob/gyn and believes mammos are recommended every year through US Preventive Task Force. She wants to join Premium Care $1500/$254 and HAB $107 = $361. I told her I will waive the $100 of $125. We''re set to have her enroll on April 2nd for July 1st start date. I''ll email her now and let her know there will be a modest price change before then.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-18 11:27:52', '2025-03-18 11:29:27'),
