  ('zcrm_1579374000161463001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130307002', 'Amanda McKannon', NULL, '03/17/2025:
Stefan called because his prescription was not covered like it used to be. He was using his planstin card so i will send him his ARM cards. He needs one for him and his wife. He also wants to know about reimbursement for the prescription that got denied. Will ask tomorrow and respond to him. AJ', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-17 16:10:27', '2025-03-17 16:10:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161417023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161588012', 'Stephanie PageWise', NULL, '3-17-25 Stephanie is 55 and was referred by Dr. Mary Ellen Francesca with Middleway Wellness. She''s been a patient since Oct. 2024. Lives in PA, therefore only Zion is allowed. Care+ and HAB are best. She has borderline high cholesterol and no ER and no meds. She had a torn meniscus 1 year ago but that''s all healed 100% and no problems. She wants an April 1st start date. She will discuss it with her husband. She''s a mental health therapist. $1000/$352 + HAB $124 with $70 reimbursable for Middleway Wellness. Therefore, it''s $406 a month after she''s reimbursed. Makes sense to include HAB. She will let me know ASAP. Knows the 20th deadline and $125/$25.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-17 15:19:13', '2025-03-17 15:19:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161458031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157224002', 'Timothy Craig', NULL, '03.17.25 TImothy wanted clarification on how sharing works. Advised need to reach IUA, need based. Psychiatry for daughter is not covered, but will be through Lyric. Son''s PT - submit imaging quote request. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-03-17 15:01:00', '2025-03-17 15:01:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161458023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131710002', 'Scott Beaton', NULL, '03.17.25 - Kaitlen from ARM notified us that none of Elizabeths bills would be covered since they are diagnostic codes (Office Visit, Ultrasound, and Mammogram). Will notify Elizabeth that it will be her financial responsibility and then a sharing request. Elizabeth was in the middle of a class and will call back. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-03-17 14:32:11', '2025-03-17 14:34:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161458001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000118784002', 'Sharma Atkinson-Staten', NULL, '03.17.25 -  Sharma is having surgery next week. Submitted her bills. Inquired about ARM and RX, guided her towards the Custom Quote Request. Also requested her 1095C JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-03-17 14:30:42', '2025-03-17 14:31:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161414083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109000002', 'Ronald Ware', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation Request eff 4/25 citing Financial Reasons.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-03-17 14:30:21', '2025-03-17 14:30:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161417013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174963059', 'Laura Waldman', NULL, '3-17-25 Laura is totally confused as to what direction she wants to take moving forward. She had 2 interviews last week and thought she was going to get the job but not sure. She stalled on setting up any self-employment. If she sets up her own new biz she can estimate her income and use those numbers moving forward. That may bump her off Medicaid but give her a good APTC. Then she won''t have to pay full price for UHC. She''s still going to PCP and PT for shoulder and other health issues. Her Dr. doesn''t accept Medicaid. So, that''s why she''s still paying $800 per month!  She will call me when she''s ready to move forward with some decisions.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-17 14:18:48', '2025-03-17 14:18:48'),
