  ('zcrm_1579374000161252173', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096033002', 'Carl Loven', NULL, '3/14/25: Carl called about scheduling colonoscopy. They are currently in virgin islands which is not showing up with any in network drs. We checked Boulder Community Hospital which did show up in PHCS network. Let them know if they needed help booking appt, we''d be happy to step in and call the providers to make sure it''s a smooth process. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-14 12:06:58', '2025-03-14 12:06:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161281008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000096033002', 'Carl Loven', NULL, '3-14-25 Carl and Mary called and we discussed that Carl will receive an email from Patti likely at the end of March with link and instructions to remove Mary for May 1st. Mary has been in communication with Andrea and Alyssa re Medicare already. Carl wants to do his colonoscopy upon return to CO in May as preventive since it''s time. After he does that, he''s thinking of dropping MEC and moving to HAB for all of the other wellness benefits for dental, vision, gym, labs, IUA, etc. They live in St Croix which is part of the US Virgin Islands and has same status as Puerto Rico. So, I''ll ask HAB if they will allow for reimbursements from there.  Also let them know he can get a skin check with HAB. Carl also had a need approved for 15 PRP visits. They used only 12. He''s been doing PT and wants the remaining PRP. I told them to submit the bills ASAP since the Need was opened Aug. 2024. It should still be an open Need still he''s still working to heal it. They are all set for now. If we make a change it will be CARE+ $352+$107 HAB = $459.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-14 12:00:34', '2025-03-14 12:00:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161252149', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000114725002', 'Louis Young', NULL, '3/14/25: Julie called wanting to know why ARM card only had husband''s name. I explained its a universal card. We also discussed submitting prev versus diag bills and some bigger bills she has for a back injury. I instructed her to go ahead and open a sharing request, connected with Zion. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-14 11:45:26', '2025-03-14 11:45:26'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161281003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065014004', 'Carrie Ballas', NULL, '3-14-25 Carrie has newly discovered she had fibroids as of 2 weeks ago. So, she won''t be switching her membership as this point. There''s a possibility of surgery maybe sometime down the road, definitely not now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-14 11:20:29', '2025-03-14 11:20:29'),
