  ('zcrm_1579374000161207008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000124104002', 'Sherwin Miguel', NULL, 'Sherwin called asked about a billing question that the Mental Health provider MSEAP set him up with asked him about payment. So I let him know that this would have to be addressed directly with MSEAP, transferred him over. This also means the task made for him to ensure he was in fact set up with someone, can be closed since he was. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-13 12:04:56', '2025-03-13 12:04:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161197153', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156177011', 'Jake Briggs', NULL, '3/13/25: Tara called needing to understand how the plan worked so they present correctly to the specialist they are going to see. I explained to present as self-pay and try to get the cash pay rate, to collect an itemized receipt and call back if they need assistance opening a sharing request. Also discussed the fact that IUAs are issue specific. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-13 11:51:14', '2025-03-13 11:51:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161215009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161417043', 'Janet Romano', NULL, '3-13-25 Janet has a genetic defect that will preclude her from being a good candidate for MCS. Both look like it will be considered pre-x. AC doesn''t look like an option either bc it is considered a heart condition/disease. So, for C4 she''s thinking she''ll have about $50K in income which comes from investments and SS. That gives her a $726 APTC. She wants Dr. Yuvrajsinh Parmar and Dr. Heidi Jo Oster. Anthem Pathway and Select Health are the only ones to accept both Drs. Select Health looks like the best option. She takes levothyroxine 88mcg, progesterone and estrdiol patch all filled every 3 months. Zip 80130 and DOB 12/23/1961. Sent her the C4 instructions to complete and she''ll call me back when she''s done today to complete the enrollment.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-13 11:39:49', '2025-03-13 11:39:49'),
