  ('zcrm_1579374000161197075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159238002', 'Steven Kleinberg', NULL, '3/13/25: Spoke to Steve for a while regarding his new plan. He has labs and follow up scheduled for next week but Dr. is not in network. I offered to do a lab quote for him but he needs to find out the names of the labs. It''s a routine visit for him but also associated with his crestor script so I''m not sure if the labs would be preventive. 
He''s going to call provider and get cash price for labs, if it''s too much then reschedule appt and have us perform a quote. I also suggested he ask office over the phone if they are contracted with PHCS. He doesn''t want to switch drs now but might in the future. 
Will check on Steve next week.
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-13 08:56:54', '2025-03-13 08:56:54'),
