  ('zcrm_1579374000161197015', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154953001', 'David Byrne', NULL, '3/13/25: Lenissa called. Her daughter was in ER with a dislocated shoulder and has a followup with Ortho who is requiring them to pay up front for appt. We discussed how funds are distributed through Zion, paying IUA, 3 IUAs in 12 mo period, what constitutes a large need after 3rd IUA, how to open member portal. Connected with Zion to open portal and begin sharing request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-13 07:19:04', '2025-03-27 07:39:18'),
