  ('zcrm_1579374000161148294', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061561019', 'Lamm Inthavong', NULL, '3-12-25 Lamm and accountant called to access the 1095-A form. I instructed them to the C4 site and they found it and downloaded it. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-12 18:12:29', '2025-03-12 18:12:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161148223', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156186015', 'Noah Burleson', NULL, '3-12-25 Noah called to understand how to get reimbursement for his wife''s mental health counseling. I referred him back to the flyer where the instructions show him how to submit for reimbursement. He sees it again and is all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-12 17:34:10', '2025-03-12 17:34:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161148186', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161093011', 'Annique Sampson', NULL, '3-12-25 Annique is enrolling in Care+ $2500/$550 EF both are 48 and Julian is son. April 1st start date. The Admin Fee is no longer billed until the 20th of the month billing date according to the other enrollments I see. She should have the money available by that point.  Paying with cc for now as well, just in case. They just had unexpected car mechanic bills.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-12 17:18:07', '2025-03-12 17:18:07'),
