  ('zcrm_1579374000161162060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000113318002', 'Thomas Parker', NULL, 'Nancy called in about the switch to ARM from planstin, and was worried her husband only got an ARM card, she didn''t and she had one with planstin with her name on it, etc. I explained everything and assured her it''s ok and not to fret as when they pull up the membership we can see her, she is covered, and lastly she really wanted a card with her name so I made a digital one and emailed. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-12 14:30:46', '2025-03-12 14:30:46'),
