  ('zcrm_1579374000161148156', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111063013', 'Stephanie Hoffman', NULL, '3-12-25 Stephanie is trying to understand the best way to handle mold toxicity, chronic fatigue and sleep insomnia with Zion. She''s in her 3rd year of membership with up to $50K sharing. May submit as fibromyalgia or as mold issue. Son had a back injury and it was treated and fine but might submit in case he has any further issues down the road so it''s tracked. We also discussed other DPC options such as Harmony Family Practice or maybe Dr. Stanley Jack (not sure if still doing DPC).  She''s paying $582 direct with Zion for DPC compliant membership at $2500 IUA and $325 for Strive Direct Health. Harmony is $220 for entire family instead. They''d save $105 per month. She''s going to check them out. She will also start her new Need for her and son.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-12 13:39:34', '2025-03-12 13:39:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161145016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404010', 'Michael Schutt', NULL, '03.12.25:  Recvd. response from Lisa. Said she''d like to schedule a Welcome Call w/Vanessa when she gets back next week. I messaged Vanessa to ask her the best way for Lisa to access the scheduler. Vanessa emailed Lisa the Welcome Call Scheduler template. I texted Lisa that she should have recvd. this email from Vanessa. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-03-12 13:25:50', '2025-03-12 13:26:53'),
