  ('zcrm_1579374000161092154', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159767002', 'Pamela Skop', NULL, '3/12/25: Spoke to Pam regarding her prescriptions. She lives 40 minutes away from a pharmacy and wants to explore mail order. I quoted her meds while on the phone and gave her instructions on how to use CostPlus mail order pharmacy. Sent email with links and specific quotes. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-12 11:30:14', '2025-03-12 11:30:14'),
