  ('zcrm_1579374000161148113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000169925030', 'Alissa Brown', NULL, '3-11-25 Alissa and Hayden are both 35 and live in ME. Referred by Amy Beley. Hayden is planning to quit his job soon and they need possible May 1st start date. They are both very healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco, no meds. Alissa was impressed when Amy''s son had a health issue and how easy it was to use. She also wants dental, vision, skin checks, labs, etc. I described Care+ $1000/$461 and HAB $200 = $661 total plus $125/$25. She also likes the supplements discount. I will send the video for her husband to watch and written overview. I already sent the HAB brochure. She was thrilled at how awesome all of this is!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-11 21:09:09', '2025-03-11 21:09:09'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161145009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083404010', 'Michael Schutt', NULL, '03.11.25:  Lisa texted me yesterday. Said she''s leaving on a trip and doesn''t have time to call but she wants to know more about any changes from her old plan to her new plan(Secure to Premium Care)   and asked if she can look at a website to find this info. I responded the best way to learn more is to schedule a Welcome Call w/Vanessa who will explain how to access and navigate her new plan services in addition to answering any questions she may have.  I told her to let me know if she wants to schedule a call and I will send her the link to the Scheduler. JSP', 'Joan Phelps', 'Joan Phelps', '2025-03-11 16:40:25', '2025-03-12 13:26:09'),
