  ('zcrm_1579374000161131006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110554002', 'Dirk Anderson', NULL, '03.11.25 - Dirk called stating that no one in his household is a smoker. Per Patti, the son Kaden enrolled as a smoker. Contacted Planstin, who needed further clarification as to what kind of mistake this was, otherwise, the guidelines requirement would need to be followed to show proof of being tobacco free. Leo will call Dirk. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-03-11 13:37:17', '2025-03-11 13:37:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161131001', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140941002', 'Mark Hostler', NULL, '03.11.25 - Lou reached out to Reba, Mark has a cancer diagnosis with 6months - 1 year time frame. He has medical bills that accumulated from Oct, Nov, Dec and he went on an ACA plan. Per Sedera Guidelines, he has a 6 month window to submit his bills for sharing. Will ask the Concierge to reach out again to let him know. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-03-11 13:14:34', '2025-03-11 13:14:34'),
