  ('zcrm_1579374000161084019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031295146', 'Keith Marshall', NULL, 'Keith called in and had a few questions. His initial reason and question for calling, is he needs some type of form that shows one of his 3 sons on the plan with him, has had this healthcare plan for over 60 days. I let him know that would be with Patti in the billing. Before I transferred him, he had a few other questions about the MEC coverage. So, I explained to him how it all works with ARM, and lastly, that I would resend out digital ARM cards. Along with putting in the request for hard copies to be mailed out to him. Put him through to Patti after explaining everything. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-11 12:37:48', '2025-03-11 12:37:48'),
