  ('zcrm_1579374000161084009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000000165336', 'Jacqueline Ambrose Woodward', NULL, 'Jackie called in and simply needed her member ID from Admin123 to change her password in the member portal. It took a long time to find her in Admin123. I tried every possible way to search for her on both the green and blue side, and I couldn''t find her. First name, last name, her old last name we have which is Healy, her emails as there were 3 different ones, nothing. Patti was able to pull her up on the greenside somehow and provided me her member ID.. I called Jackie back and she declined my call, but I left a VM with her member ID. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-11 12:17:55', '2025-03-11 12:17:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000161103048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157983003', 'Remy Godwin', NULL, 'Kelly asked me to call this member as he is requesting some Tax Document for his payroll co.  I explained to him that he is technically paying as an individual, however he has membership in a plan that is only available to business owners.  I explained to him that we do not give tax advise nor supply any tax forms and that he would have to consult a tax professional.  Member later called back and told me he misread what was required of him.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-03-11 12:07:47', '2025-03-11 12:07:47'),
