  ('zcrm_1579374000161025017', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156781406', 'Megan Ila', NULL, '3-10-25 Megan called to better understand 1Dental and will likely join. She and her husband just want some basic protection. She knows many of the dentists showing up in the network bc they live in a small community in Montrose. She''s going to River Valley Family Health Center (showing in the Dental Access Network) but might want to choose another dentist. She sees the options and is excited to join. She has my link. Used their 81401 zip code and they are in their early to mid 50''s.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-10 14:37:02', '2025-03-10 14:37:02'),
