  ('zcrm_1579374000160845074', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091199008', 'Astraea Davidson', NULL, 'Member called in with many questions about her membership.  She has moved and wondered would her price go down.  Told her no.  She has purchased a $6000 functional medicine plan and wants to know if it would integrate with her membership.   She is also using a Chiropractor to alleviate pain in her neck and numbness in her hands.  She also priced out getting an IUD and was quoted $1000.  She is also exploring going to Care + and adjusting her IUA to possibly save some money.  
