  ('zcrm_1579374000160831100', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000091199008', 'Astraea Davidson', NULL, 'Astraea called in and needs to find a provider in the network to have her women''s well visit done and have an IUD. I told her I would certainly do the research for providers in the network and send her my findings. I explained most gyno places can do both so I will call to make sure so she doesn''t have to drive all over the place. I explained to her I would send her everything via email and confirmed her email address. She was very thankful. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-06 13:02:36', '2025-03-06 13:02:36'),
