  ('zcrm_1579374000160831009', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000083686002', 'Jeffrey Lee', NULL, 'Dina called in after hours and left a VM with us. She requested to have a list of Pediatric GI specialists in her area emailed over to her. I have done the search and emailed her the list I found. I also explained how she presents herself and how this will all work privy to her IUA. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-06 06:58:21', '2025-03-06 06:58:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160806013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650188', 'Lauren Stanko', NULL, '3-5-25 Lauren re-enrolled today into Premium Care. They are members of a DPC. I told her about the 6 month wait for mammo and colonoscopy. They are fine with that since they aren''t really old enough anyhow. She got the payment information from her employer and will be starting their membership again for April 1st, 2025 after it was erroneously cancelled by JK about 2 years ago!!  MPB kept paying Sedera but then cancelled altogether back in Sept. 2024. She will complete the Welcome Call again to make sure the virtual healthcare is set up again. I sent her the written overview also. So, they should be up to speed. I waived the $100 referral fee since they were supposed to be active members all along!  They chose $1000/$837 with Lauren as primary since she will manage the account. John is now 40 and Lauren is 36.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-05 21:21:11', '2025-03-05 21:21:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160806008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019634002', 'Colleen Mangeot', NULL, '3-5-25 Hi Wendy,

Patti let me know that this has been corrected. 

Let me know if there is anything I could do. 

Julia
---- on Tue, 25 Feb 2025 13:16:09 -0500 Wendy Scipione<wendys@mympb.com> wrote ----
Hi Team,

Colleen Mangeot went to open a Need today and was told her IUA changed from $1000 to $2500. She did NOT request this. It was changed for Jan. 1st, 2025. She''s getting billed $300 vs $352. She is fine with the $352/$1000 since that''s what she chose from the beginning. It looks like someone in Admin mistakenly changed her IUA without her permission or desire. She did not submit a Change Form to change the IUA. She did submit a change of email and payment in Jan. Please help to correct this ASAP. She needs to submit her Need after an accident yesterday.  This needs to be backdated to the Dec. 20th payment for Jan 2025 onward.

Thanks,

Wendy', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-05 15:45:38', '2025-03-05 15:45:38'),
