  ('zcrm_1579374000160674113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155307001', 'Thomas Manzi', NULL, '03.04.2025- Called in because his credit card was charged for his preventative physical. Told him we would probably need to call ARM to see why his provider was not reimbursed or find out why he wasn''t. Told him first thing tomorrow we would jump on that and find out why A.J.', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2025-03-04 16:50:32', '2025-03-04 16:50:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160674108', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073002089', 'Katie Borgen', NULL, '03.04.2025 - Kathryn called stating her membership is getting too expensive. I told her she needs to talk with her advisor but she did not want to call right now and was talking about canceling. I sent her the price sheet for Secure HSA since she is on that membership and plan to message Wendy to inform her of the situation with her member. A.J.', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2025-03-04 16:46:55', '2025-03-04 16:46:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160691040', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081634027', 'Julia Bolz', NULL, '3-4-25  I received this from Ameritas per Julia''s account:
Ameritas is reviewing our outstanding license and appointment discrepancies and have found that Wendy Scipione has commissions pending in a state where you don''t hold a license.  We are not able to locate a license in the following state(s):  Wisconsin

