___________________

I looked into getting licensed in WI and it will cost $167.84 . I believe this is just for dental or vision which will take forever to pay that amount back. So, I''ll leave it alone.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-04 15:53:39', '2025-03-04 15:53:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160674098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212047', 'Luther Setzer', NULL, '03.03.2025 - Luther called in to make sure his benefits did not change since we moved from planstin to arm due to him having a new card and information. Wanted to know the procedure for prescriptions and i told him to put in his quote request and we would run it for him. A.J.', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2025-03-04 15:47:03', '2025-03-04 15:47:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160674093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011740129', 'Julia (Wieck) Hardy', NULL, '03.04.2025 Julia called in after hours, needs a Hematologists because she was trying to go to Rocky Mountain Cancer Center and they do not take self pay patients. Needs assistance finding someone to look at some of her bloodwork due to an upcoming surgery and they have certain markers in the blood work that need to be seen by this specialist. Wanted to make sure she was taken care of so i informed her we would get back to her during office hours first thing tomorrow morning with some options for her. A.J.', 'Adam Jordano', 'Adam Jordano', '2025-03-04 15:16:25', '2025-03-04 15:16:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160709011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109789017', 'Pamela Wende', NULL, '03.04.25 Pamela needed assistance locating PCP in her area for preventive care. Sent her the results from PHCS. She also injured her knee and may need physical therapy. Advised to present as cash pay, meet IUA and submit for sharing. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-03-04 14:47:07', '2025-03-04 14:47:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160691029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146373002', 'Francisco Ansaldo', NULL, '3-4-25 Francisco just completed the Member Change Form to add his wife. Got to confirmation page.  They got married and she''s still waiting on getting her SS#. She has a green card now. I had him put in an obviously wrong SS# since it''s not required. She will also be changing her name but that will take a while. She will join CARE+ with him. She will also join HAB $107 on her own without Francisco. They completed both forms and are all set! Super nice. These will take effect April 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-04 14:35:40', '2025-03-04 14:41:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160664150', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000135095093', 'Joel Perez', NULL, 'Amy called in and needed her digital ARM card resent to her and hard copies requested to be sent. As nothing came to them yet in the mail but Joel found the email sent to him origionally with his ARM card digitally. I made one for AMY and sent to her email. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-04 14:35:34', '2025-03-04 14:35:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160691024', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152284778', 'David Spear', NULL, '3-4-25 Shelby called bc she got two conflicting 1095-B forms, one from Medicaid and 1 C4. Only month of Dec. is in question. I recommended she goes back to Medicaid and asks them to fix the form for Dec. showing she didn''t have Medicaid bc they had an APTC with C4. She will try that.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-04 14:02:33', '2025-03-04 14:02:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160691019', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175078001', 'Christopher Parsons', NULL, '3-4-25 I presented to Chris'' team which included Sharon, Jeff and Candy via a phone discussion. I described Premium Care and HSA with HAB. They have clients who might be interested in this and possible groups. The savings is about 50%.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-04 13:58:30', '2025-03-04 13:58:30'),
