  ('zcrm_1579374000160666092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133732002', 'Megan Keyser', 'New Membership eff 4/25', 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-03-04 10:26:32', '2025-03-04 10:26:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160691003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044650188', 'Lauren Stanko', NULL, '3-4-25 Talked with Patti about this account. The Stanko''s inquired with Sedera about their monthly share amount and Sedera referred them back to MPB. Patti dug into their account and can''t find any proof of cancellation anywhere. They didn''t cancel. However, John Kach looks to have cancelled them per Admin123 for unknown reasons. They were last billed on Nov. 2022, ie. cancelled for 1-1-23 erroneously. MPB kept paying Sedera until Sept. 2024 without receiving payment from the Stanko''s. I just called Lauren and fortunately they don''t have an pre-x other than her son got a gash on his head in Feb. which they were going to submit. The cost so far is about $1200. It will cost them less to just pay the bills for that and start fresh with their membership for April 1st. The reason they didn''t notice the payment missing is bc John''s employer pays for their membership!  Lauren was very nice! They saved about $13K. So, paying for this one small incident won''t be a problem. She will discuss with her husband about which IUA level to choose for Premium Care $1000/$837 or $1500/$741. Premium Care is basically the same as the previous Direct membership. I need to remind her of the 6 month waiting period for a colonoscopy! No pre-x other than the gash that should be one and done.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-04 10:23:47', '2025-03-04 10:27:42'),
