  ('zcrm_1579374000160674023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159614001', 'Kathryn Rouse', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to send out welcome packet. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-04 09:04:50', '2025-03-04 09:04:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160664075', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080702012', 'Jonathan Bill', NULL, 'Jonathan called in and said that he wanted to know what the traveling looked like in terms of coverage. I explained the bills just need to be in English for anything to be shared past the IUA. He also asked about maternity, to which I explained is the same as an IUA, and lastly, he said he is going to need an MRI on his shoulder, so that I would send him the link for research to be done on finding pricing. He said the hospital gave him a cash price of $500, so he wants to know if there is anything cheaper. I said I would send him the link and we will look into it. He is all set. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-04 08:49:23', '2025-03-04 08:49:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160674008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134794006', 'Jonathan Martinez', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Put in request to Kelly to send out welcome packet. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-04 08:23:47', '2025-03-04 08:23:47'),
