  ('zcrm_1579374000160664053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129740002', 'Dana Weddle', NULL, 'Dana needed his 2024 1095C. I put his together as he needed it right then and there and emailed it over to him. -He called and left a VM over night last night after hours. He is all set. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-04 07:55:40', '2025-03-04 07:55:40'),
