  ('zcrm_1579374000160664003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157231043', 'jennifer dudley-Pieropan', NULL, 'Jennifer called in after hours and left a voicemail about an injury her son has in Hawaii. I called and left a voicemail for her this time. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-03-04 07:16:17', '2025-03-04 07:16:17'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160566046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161417043', 'Janet Romano', NULL, '3-3-35 Janet just retired and was referred by Ben Di Salle (Financial Advisor). Janet watched the video and let me know immediately that she has a bicuspid heart valve that she was born with. It''s never been a problem. She''s very healthy, active, no smoking or tobacco, etc. She gets it screened and never been a problem. Her last screening was in 2024. I let her know I''d inquire to find out how they will view this since we don''t want to take any risks. I submitted by inquiry and she wants me to call her as soon as I hear back. She''s flexible now since she''s not working.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-03 15:39:20', '2025-03-03 15:39:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160566041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163967002', 'Alicia Thompson', NULL, '3-3-25 Alicia is 63. She watched the video twice. She asked many questions about the wellness benefits. She needs this for June 1st start date and knows May 20th or prior Friday is the deadline. She takes Armour Thyroid which I found only 60 mg not 90 mg for $103.50 which means about $31 per month. She takes terbinafine HCL but I couldn''t find any with HCL. I priced the non HCL as a baseline. She also take valacyclovir which was about $25 -$30 on GoodRX. So, she''s not too worried about any of those and Concierge will check many more resources that I did. Looking at Premium Care $1000/$285 and HAB $107 for June, 2025.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-03 15:32:04', '2025-03-03 15:32:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160566033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160613002', 'Emily Thomas', NULL, '3-3-25 Brandi Stanley reminded Emily of me and the memberships when she just lost her employer benefits either Feb. 14th or 28th. She''s not sure when they ended. She was looking into C4 but her therapist was not included even though she was told the therapist accepts UHC and Aetna. They were not included in the individual C4 plans. That was her most important need. She''s healthy, no pre-x, no tobacco. Her new company gives her a $500 stipend towards healthcare! I quoted her Premium Care $1000/$285 and HAB $107 = $392. She gets to keep the difference as well!  She will use dental, vision, annual screenings, skin check, gym and most importantly mental health. She doesn''t use tobacco and just takes birth control for med.  She was working for her previous company as an independent contractor and dropped to part-time. Then they seem to have increased her hours back to full-time and benes. Anyhow, she was thrilled for Premium Care and HAB. She''s all set for April 1st start date!  IF she''s offered Cobra she might be able to hop on that and back date IF something happens in March.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-03-03 13:57:56', '2025-03-03 13:58:41'),
