  ('zcrm_1579374000160490279', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000006644205', 'Martha Rybak', NULL, 'David called in and needed new digital ARM cards emailed to them for him and his family, along with I put a request out to have hard copies mailed out too. All set. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-28 13:28:47', '2025-02-28 13:28:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160482045', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000085447002', 'Michael Grimaldi', NULL, 'Per Leo this member''s adult child called in and told us that this member passed away.  I advised keeping the membership active while any final expenses are taken care of, however after speaking with Zion the member''s child elected to cancel.  I will process now (effective 3/25) so I can refund the Share Amount', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-28 13:20:41', '2025-02-28 13:20:41'),
