  ('zcrm_1579374000160490258', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160015001', 'Paul Beck', NULL, 'Adina put in an RX request form, to which I looked up and sent over the coupons. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-28 12:51:30', '2025-02-28 12:51:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160490243', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128112002', 'Jessica Christianson', NULL, 'Jessie emailed in about wanting us to get some kind of update to her about a preventative claim she mailed in to ARM. She things she saw an email response sent to her, but now she can''t find the email. So, I forwarded her email to Kait at ARM, along with CCing Jessie to get an update in real time. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-28 12:39:29', '2025-02-28 12:39:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160490238', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160110002', 'Lonnie Plaster', NULL, 'Member &amp; Spouse $1500 IUA Premium Care. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-28 12:24:46', '2025-02-28 12:24:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160490223', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027924017', 'Rodger Paxton', NULL, 'Jess called in asking about a geriachtric surgery she is looking to get, but I made clear if this was something she NEEDS to have done medically, or if this is just a personal choice for the weight loss. I asked due to what her question was. There is an extra add-on persay of extra cost that the doctor told Jessica about for if there is any kind of medical complications god forbid, during the aftercare of the surgery, then if she pays for something, and that occurs, it will be covered. But she didn''t want to pay anything yet that is extra if Zion her healthsharing is already going to be paying for, why pay twice for it. So, since her answer was this is medically necessary as her health is in danger according to her. Then Zion will cover everything after paying her IUA of $2500. I explained this all to her and her second question was info for the counceling services we offer that Charles Frohman emailed her about. I explained briefly but that I sent an email to them with more details about how to proceed making sessions happen with MSEAP. All set for now. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-28 12:22:56', '2025-02-28 12:22:56'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160490193', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133865034', 'Astrid Weisseise', NULL, 'Astrid called in about the change over from Planstin to ARM, resent her digital ARM card, requested hard copies to be sent after verifying mailing address, explained how preventative works with presenting herself, PHCS Network, etc. Lastly, Astrid asked if the cancer skin check appointment is a shared expense with ARM for preventative care. I explained yes, as long as they just look and do the skin check. If anything is found and any skin biopsies have to be done, then no, it will no longer be covered. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-28 12:05:52', '2025-02-28 12:05:52'),
