  ('zcrm_1579374000160482003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000036932155', 'Amy Betancourt', 'Decline of 3/25 Share Amount', '2/28-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm  Member called in and directed me to rerun pmt.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-28 06:55:09', '2025-02-28 14:19:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160419068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '2-27-25 Hilary confirmed that Kyle set up with Medicaid as an independent adult. Therefore only his income matters and he qualifies for Medicaid. She got Medicaid all sorted out directly with them. All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-27 19:10:33', '2025-02-27 19:10:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160419063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011083191', 'Greg Haarburger', NULL, '2-27-25 My response to Greg''s concern that his Need was taking too long. 

I received this response regarding your open Need.

"Good to hear from you. Yes, I looked into Greg''s Need and the invoice for the surgery was sent to negotiations. That can be a process of 60-90 days. His Needs Coordinator said that the negotiations have just been completed and Greg should receive an email today with sharing information. "

It looks like everything is on track with your Needs Case.

Cheers,
Wendy', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-27 17:22:16', '2025-02-27 17:22:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160419058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010059019', 'Lewis Farrell', NULL, '2-27-25 Lewis called to help his son Alexander Farrell access is MAP mental health benefits. He''s in a bit of a crisis it sounds like. I left him a long vm giving him the MPB Concierge Team and let him know they are available for another hour today or to try tomorrow. I also let him know I have another wellness benefit that might be helpful if he thinks this is a longer term need.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-27 17:09:38', '2025-02-27 17:09:38'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160419053', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746009', 'Jill Bryant', NULL, '2-27-25 Jill was inquiring about Medicare and timing of cancellation. She and John Spalvins are living in Costa Rica during the winters now and Evergreen in the summers.  They are building/remodeling their new home now and adding a pool. It''s right near tons of beaches in Tamarindo on the Nicoya Peninsula. Since they are now residents, they are covered by the system in CR but they have to go to the gov hospitals, not private hospitals. She said health care is great there! John will have gap month in March and will get Medicare going through Andrea for April 1st. All set for now and super nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-27 16:53:43', '2025-02-27 16:53:43'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160419048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155863212', 'Hillary Thomas', NULL, '2-27-25 Tracy called asking about a 1095 form. I called and left a vm letting her know it''s not required, no penalty and to form will be sent bc not insurance.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-27 16:38:50', '2025-02-27 16:38:50');
