  ('zcrm_1579374000160387008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000059061132', 'David Pool', 'Decline of 3/25 Share Amount', '2/27-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm spoke to spouse and she directed me to rerun', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-27 07:59:04', '2025-02-27 08:22:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160388020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476142', 'Michael Dee', NULL, 'Michael put in a Bob message after hours, to which I responded back to Michael needing to have sent his digital ARM card to him again, I looked up Boulder Medical Center if they are in the network, they are. So, Michael is needing his annual wellness visit. He doesn''t use this plan as often, so when he needs to go about his annual, he needs a little help navigating everything. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-27 07:35:06', '2025-02-27 07:35:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160388003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000021919047', 'Tatiana Moroz', NULL, 'Tatiana left a message with us this morning before hours with Bob. She is pregnant and wanted to know how to go about everything. She stated it is very early still, but still wants to figure out what the process is with her plan. I explained to her since she has been on the plan for a few years, she has no waiting period to wait for until anything is shared. So, I told her how it normally works then as any normal sharing request with Sedera. I transferred her over to Sedera to have someone go over everything with her. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-27 07:23:53', '2025-02-27 07:23:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160387003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139729018', 'Raeanna Clarke', NULL, 'Member submitted Cancellation effective 3/25 citing financial reasons.  per below she has already spoken to Wendy.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-27 07:19:12', '2025-02-27 07:19:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160358060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000174963059', 'Laura Waldman', NULL, '2-25-25 Laura is 58 and referred by Suzy Martinek. She lost her job in July 2024 and is on C4 now. She was getting spousal support from x-husband but that ended. She''s paying about $400 w/ UHC. She''s super frustrated with UHC for Many reasons! She had shoulder replacement surgery recently.  Her cost recently went up to $800+ and then qualified for Medicaid. Her father and x-husband are Drs. and she doesn''t want to just go to any Dr. if she uses Medicaid.  She''s finishing up with her ortho for her shoulder. She sees a nurse practitioner for a bladder infection, handles hormone stuff, tongue issue called thrush and sees an internal medicine dr. Also sees a psychiatrist and therapist. Has a thyroid issues. Not good candidate for MCS. She''s working on self-employment income and thinking she could try to get it to $25K ish to qualify for an APTC and get of of Medicaid and off of full cost UHC.  She''s considering trying for March 1st of April 1st start date. Also very interested in HAB for mental health and other benefits.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-26 21:31:40', '2025-02-26 21:31:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160358042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065104032', 'Clove Berger', NULL, '2-26-25 Left vm for Clove following up with her call to me.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-26 17:13:25', '2025-02-26 17:13:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160358037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157412021', 'Christopher Ochs', NULL, '2-26-25 Chris called to make sure he knows how to cancel with Zion. I gave him the 1-888-920-9466 to cancel with them since he joined with them directly. He will do so. He''s all set with Premium Care for March 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-26 16:48:55', '2025-02-26 16:48:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160358032', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000163967002', 'Alicia Thompson', NULL, '2-26-25 Alicia had breast cancer 9 years ago. Zion told her that would still be considered pre-x!  I reviewed Sedera''s Guidelines and I don''t believe it will still be considered pre-x. I''ll tell her to read the Guidelines. She will watch the 9 min video before we talk again on Monday. She''s interested in HAB possibly but not sure if she can afford it too. I priced out Premium Care $1000/$285 and HAB $107.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-26 16:33:48', '2025-02-26 16:33:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160358027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139729018', 'Raeanna Clarke', NULL, '2-26-25 Raeanna needs to cancel bc she just lost one of her two jobs. Her income is about $1100-$1400 a month. This is within Medicaid level. I sent her the link to cancel Care+ and to apply for Medicaid for March 1st, if she wishes. She wants to keep HAB.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-26 16:16:14', '2025-02-26 16:16:14'),
