  ('zcrm_1579374000160330123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152299038', 'Ray Stewart', NULL, 'Ray called during our meeting and left a Bob message. He just needed the correct email address for Kait over at arm to send in claims. He had her email spelled wrong as kati@altrisk.com, which it is kait@altrisk.com. I provided him her correct email domain. All set for now. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-26 14:01:54', '2025-02-26 14:01:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160330084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155090002', 'Ione Butler', NULL, '2/28 opened a support ticket for ione son with the following email JonButlermusic@gmail.com AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-26 12:39:42', '2025-02-28 08:18:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160330071', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000149291002', 'Donna Boysen', NULL, 'Donna called in and asked where &amp; how to upload her first receipt/bill she has that she paid for, regarding an eye issue she has been diagnosed with. She knows about being cash pay of her $1000 IUA, but didn''t know where exactly to submit everything. I told her about Zion Health and when she gets her other receipt/bill a little later today, she will call us back to have someone at Zion, help walk her through everything to get started with her first Sharing Request. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-26 12:05:58', '2025-02-26 12:05:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160330066', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000144701052', 'Joseph Anderson', NULL, 'Joe called in and said and gave the wrong card & info at his preventative appt he is at right now. He tried giving the MPB QR card and said he is under a group plan, to which the Dr''s office said they don''t take group plans. So I explained to him that he was sent his digital ARM card on Dec. 11th and he did open it. But I explained his preventative benefits is through ARM. He is to show that cards, as I resent it to his email that was verified, and he can also have them call ARM directly to verify benefits. Gave all info needed. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-26 11:35:22', '2025-02-26 11:35:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160330025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130192002', 'Retha Parsley', NULL, 'Retha called in and said she spoke to the other girl (Acelyn) earlier today and is getting Antsy. Wanted to know of any updates. I told her I will have Acelyn give her a call back once she is back from lunch. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-26 11:07:14', '2025-02-26 11:07:14'),
