  ('zcrm_1579374000160305061', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647211', 'Jacqueline Woodward', NULL, 'Jackie called in and just needed verbal clarification that if there are NO Polyps found during her husband''s colonoscopy, will it still be a covered preventative expense. I told her absolutely. As long as NOTHING, Polyps, etc. is found and nothing is removed, or anything related to those regards, then yes, the appointment is still considered preventative and will be paid for by ARM. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-26 09:55:15', '2025-02-26 09:55:15'),
