  ('zcrm_1579374000160305048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011862078', 'Marissa Merchant', NULL, 'Marissa called and left a BOB message asking about her digital ARM and hard copies of her cards. I have put together digital ARM cards for herself, her husband, and her 2 children. All with their individual names & member ID numbers on them so she can be confident of coverage. She also asked about preventative coverage being a part of her plan. I assured her it is and in the email with her digital ARM cards, I highlighted in bold in the 1st paragraph about the list of ALL Preventative services that are covered just the same as it was with Planstin. Lastly, I put the request to had hard copies of cards sent to them all through the ARM portal. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-26 09:00:51', '2025-02-26 09:05:08'),
