  ('zcrm_1579374000160305027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000110308002', 'Robert Golden', NULL, 'Called Robert back from a BOB that he left with us after hours yesterday. He asked if the Shingles shot is part of the preventative care covered with his plan. To which I said it certainly was, he mentioned his doctor is retiring and he wants to see him one last time for hie annual physical. He asked if that would be ok for him to do come July 12th, since his last yearly physical was July 10th or so. I told him it won''t be a problem and is the best thing to do actually since his Dr. is retiring, and Robert knows the Dr. is in the network. So that will get his big appointment for the year out of the way knowing it will be taken care of like usual. I resent his digital ARM card, along with one for his wife Kathleen as his request. I lastly, put a request for Hard copies of the ARM cards to be sent since he hasn''t gotten them yet or possibly threw them out being a long time ago. He is all set for now. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-26 07:55:58', '2025-02-26 07:55:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160299021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128336007', 'Aurelia Gharzuzi', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 3/25 citing job changes.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-26 07:52:03', '2025-02-26 07:52:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160299016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131703002', 'Avigail Cahn', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 3/25 citing getting Employer Benefits.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-26 07:43:08', '2025-02-26 07:43:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160305003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000057125429', 'John Smieszek', NULL, 'Kathleen called in after hours and left a Bob message, as I called her back the following morning today. She did not pick up so, I left a voicemail explaining her plan is in fact still active and never will not be unless John the primary her husband, calls in and wishes to cancel, and lastly would have had to sign the cancelation form to be canceled. Kathleen also said she is worried for coverage of her children. Which all 3 kids are on the plan, so they are covered the same as she is. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-26 07:37:13', '2025-02-26 07:37:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160299011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000143456001', 'Enock Freire', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 3/25 due to getting other coverage.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-26 07:22:25', '2025-02-26 07:22:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160299006', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137206018', 'Laura Johnson', NULL, 'Member submitted cancellation eff 1/1/25.  citing going on spouses Employer coverage.  I can cancel her eff 3/1/25.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-26 07:13:40', '2025-02-26 07:13:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160238172', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154586379', 'James Benvenuto', NULL, '2-25-25 James reached out bc he got a lab bill for $800 from his preventative screening. I told him to have the Dr. re-code the bill and resubmit. But, some or much of it might not be covered. So, disgusting that they do this.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-25 22:41:53', '2025-02-25 22:41:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160283008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146505011', 'Kathleen Clarke', NULL, '02.25.25 - Kathleen had questions about lab work, preventive vs diagnostic. Advised to research the codes and call us back if anything is diagnostic. Present her ARM card for mammogram. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-02-25 15:10:29', '2025-02-25 15:10:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160283003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '02.25.25 - Hillary called looking for help searching for a new DR. directed her towards PHCS and Healthcare Blue Book. She also mentioned that Kyle''s psychiatrist said he has no mental health issues, advised to submit that paperwork to Zion to see if that could determine the sharing requests as eligible. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-02-25 13:17:47', '2025-02-25 13:17:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160271080', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000044006639', 'Ashley Semidey', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to add newborn to membership.  I will add', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-25 12:57:51', '2025-02-25 12:57:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160238167', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000161093011', 'Annique Sampson', NULL, '2-25-25 Annique is married with two kids 16 and 18. They are with Knew Health right now paying $525 for the $5000 IUA per incident. They are all super healthy, no pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. They take supplements. She''s most interested in Care+ bc they don''t bother with wellness visits. She''s interested in changing for April 1st start date. She needs to make sure they have enough money to pay the $125 initial cost. She will share with her husband and likely join for April 1st. Looking at Care+ $2500/$550 likely or $1000/$672.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-25 12:48:54', '2025-02-25 12:48:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160271072', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000080021001', 'Amy Fowler', NULL, 'Member called in and asked why a protion of her husband''s colonoscopy was not paid for.  this amounted to roughly $200 which she told me was for the anesthesia.  She did not know if the provider was in the network.  I directed her to Planstin to find out exactly why this was not paid.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-25 12:34:20', '2025-02-25 12:34:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160238162', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019634002', 'Colleen Mangeot', NULL, '2-25-25 I called Colleen and let her know her IUA will be reset back to $1000, as it was supposed to be. I told her to wait a few days for Planstin to correct it in their system and then to submit her need even though she hasn''t hit the $1000 yet. She was very appreciative. Just hurt herself a little from skiing and needs PT and time to heal.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-25 12:33:46', '2025-02-25 12:33:46'),
