  ('zcrm_1579374000160271052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019634002', 'Colleen Mangeot', NULL, 'After speaking to Planstin they said that as long as went sent in a corrected file with the correct IUA this would reset.  They advised me to have her wait til end of week to start submitting bills.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-25 12:19:34', '2025-02-25 12:19:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160271037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000019634002', 'Colleen Mangeot', NULL, 'Member called in because she was in touch with Zion who told her that her IUA had changed to $2500.  I looked at this and her membership was changed in error during the whole Price update project.  I will change members price to the correct price moving forward.  I will also see if Ashlee can help with this as she is in the middle of a need.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-25 11:37:24', '2025-02-25 11:37:24'),
