  ('zcrm_1579374000160211003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000076954787', 'Christopher Megroz', NULL, '2-24-25 Gordy called bc Tess got a job at Aspen Valley Ski Club AVSC and they are offering insurance. He''s not sure how good or bad the insurance is and will inquire. It would be at no cost to her. BUT, if she doesn''t accept it they will give her more paid time off. So, I told him to find out how many days and what they are looking for extra income on that front to help us compare whether or not it''s worth taking their ins on top of keeping their current membership. They aren''t looking to give up her membership. He will get more information and reach out if it''s still not clear.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-24 11:59:10', '2025-02-24 11:59:10'),
