  ('zcrm_1579374000160162008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081707002', 'Christina Johnson', NULL, 'Christina called in again late Friday evening. I spoke to her earlier during the day and was able to get her to Zion about starting a sharing request. The message she left calling back after hours, is about the same issue. I just called Christina back and she didn''t answer, so I left a message. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-24 07:08:35', '2025-02-24 07:08:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160162003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130571025', 'Charlotte Cadieux', NULL, 'Charlotte called in before the hours of us being open and online and left a message. She just needed clarification on what to do in an emergency situation. I called her back and explained the process of how that all work. She is all set. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-24 07:02:17', '2025-02-24 07:02:17'),
