  ('zcrm_1579374000160062064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073656055', 'Ronald Ivanick', NULL, 'Member called in and had some questions about why his share amount went up so much.  I found his price was very old and that he did not have any of the price increases that we had in 2022.  So his membership took a big jump.  He is looking to increase IUA to $5000 to get costs down and possible sometime in the future switch to the Secure membership.  I will send him the link to the change form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-21 11:51:25', '2025-02-21 11:51:25'),
