  ('zcrm_1579374000160062049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159592007', 'Ian Simpson', NULL, 'I spoke to member and since he has other coverage that won''t end until 4/1/25 he wants to push start date til then.  I will apply the pmt I just got to the 3/20 billing &amp; next pmt will be 4/20 for 5/25.  NEW START DATE 4/1/25', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-21 11:14:48', '2025-02-21 11:14:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160088013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099710012', 'Shane Lebsack', NULL, '1-21-25 Linda called bc her payment changed from $733 to $754.99 and wanted to know why. It looks like she changed her payment from ACH to cc. She will change it to ACH right now. I directed her to the form.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-21 11:12:12', '2025-02-21 11:12:12'),
