  ('zcrm_1579374000160074033', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156186015', 'Noah Burleson', NULL, '02.21.25 - Noah wanted to know info on his wellness package/mental health. I think it is HAB directly through Wendy. Will forward her the contact. Also sending Noah the WC schedule link. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-02-21 10:25:47', '2025-02-21 10:25:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160062036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081598001', 'Lindsay Langley', 'Decline of 3/25 Share Amount', '2/21-1st notice sent to member &amp; advisor via em &amp; vm  I spoke to member and she directed me to rerun pmt  Looks like it went through', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-21 10:13:54', '2025-02-21 10:26:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000160088003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031044058', 'Samantha Midler', NULL, '2-21-25  Sammy called bc her wellness visit was declined bc she used the RCI card. I told her to make sure anything for wellness this year needs to go through ARM. I sent her to her email and she found the ARM digital card. I told her the hard copy is delayed bc of new pharmacy benes. Also she was recently diagnosed with alopecia ariata and needs to open a new Need. I gave her Concierge # to call to create a new Need and coached her on how it all works. He visit and diagnosis was in  Nov. 2024. She now knows of the 6 month time limit to submit and will continue to accrue the ongoing bills. She''s taking Olumiant which is about $2K. She getting the free samples from her Dr. now but I told her to have the Concierge price it out as well. One place that''s lower is pharmacy checker for $828. But, they can check all of the options and hopefully find even better than that price.  She will work on the new Need and proceed. Super nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-21 10:11:25', '2025-02-21 10:11:25'),
