  ('zcrm_1579374000159980026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000061924134', 'Kristen Lassalette', NULL, '2-20-25 Kristen has an outstanding $500+ bill from Aspen Valley Health for preventive visit. She worked with Nahla and Angee and now both are gone. She''s upset bc her provider re-coded it to preventive and submitted it. Now Planstin Rep Katalina just told her they don''t allow for direct billing from the provider to Planstin which is totally false. I asked Kristen to forward the email to me and I''ll pass it to my contact at Planstin to get resolved once and for all.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-20 13:04:52', '2025-02-20 13:04:52'),
