  ('zcrm_1579374000159958128', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115938061', 'Susan Lee', NULL, 'Member submitted Change form to change membership from Secure to Care + eff 3/25.  She is located in CA which is not advisable.  I will process.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-20 12:12:50', '2025-02-20 12:12:50'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159958123', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000160004001', 'Hannah Lorenzo', NULL, 'Member &amp; Sp $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-20 12:05:24', '2025-02-20 12:05:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159957152', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131323009', 'Luke Brungardt', NULL, 'Luke called in twice and first asked about how to go about his wife having sinus issues for a while now and needs to go see a specialist. Luke was wondering if there was anyway to go aorund having to get a referral or if that is the correct way to go about it. I told him for this particual situation since they need/want to see a specialist about this, she does need to see her primary to get a referral about this. They are to pay out of pocket for everything including the primary visit for the referral and nothing more than their IUA. I told him once she gets that referral to call back into here and we can do a search/lookup for the specialist visit for best pricing as well. We will go from there. The 2nd call was if it would be the same thing as being cash pay for their daughters sick visit, I said yes, but the wellness checkup prior to her getting sick would be covered under ARM, which he knows how to use ARM, has the card, etc. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-20 12:00:08', '2025-02-20 12:00:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159958118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159997002', 'Kira Lewis', NULL, 'Member Only $2500 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-20 11:45:01', '2025-02-20 11:45:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159957139', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000108522002', 'Michael Hulstrom', NULL, 'Karen called in and asked for a digital ARM card for her husband, to which now that Dave from ARM sent to the concierge email a couple days ago the digital card template that we can use right then and there to send members if we don''t have theirs. Or instances like this as a lot of members like Karen call in asking for cards with their depedents names on it. Now we can. Sending Karen''s husbands digital ARM card now. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-20 11:44:59', '2025-02-20 11:44:59'),
