  ('zcrm_1579374000159817113', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098599023', 'Mujtaba Saifuddin', NULL, 'Mujtaba called in and was really frustrated and upset, he is very sick and earlier 3 hours ago he has been having problems resetting his password with CirrusMD on the mobile app and it wouldn''t do anything when reentering a new password and clicking confirm. He said he called earlier and the young lady (Didn''t get her name, but Acelyn was the only other person) he spoke to said they would call back in a couple hours and he said its been more than 3, no call back. He is very sick, I can hear how he sounds and is terrible. but he said he never used his services before, pays a lot of money, and the one time he is sick and needs it he cant and was frustrated. I walked him through and said to try to do so with cirrusmd on a browser. he didn''t know you could. I at least got the email sent to him to reset the password, so he didn''t have to do much. Everything worked out and he got in, got his password reset and was super super thankful and said he wished he called earlier and spoke to me. All set. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-19 13:12:10', '2025-02-19 13:12:10'),
