  ('zcrm_1579374000159863118', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159250002', 'Lexi Baldwin', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call after start date of March 1, 2025. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-19 11:03:34', '2025-02-19 11:03:34'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159859043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '2-19-25 Hilary called wanting a card for their Urgent Care visit. I let her know that HAB and Zion don''t have co-pays for urgent care. HAB is for preventive only and Zion for bigger health issues. Her daughter just needs a strep test and they will have to pay the cash price. She no longer sees the value of HAB. They still have a MEC. They are not really using the mental health benefits. She was at urgent care and had to hop off the phone. She''s considering cancelling HAB but will call me back later to finish our conversation.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-19 10:58:41', '2025-02-19 10:58:41'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159859038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154367025', 'Denise Kraal', NULL, '2-19-25 Denise and Mark are tired of dealing with Anthem. They continue to make everything difficult by denying everything and calling them is impossible. She''s just finishing PT for a shoulder problem and they will gladly pay for it on their own since that''s pretty much what''s been happening anyways. They know it will be pre-x. Denise has dual citizenship here in US and Netherlands. She does all of her wellness visits in the Netherlands for $90!  So, no point in doing any of it here. She mentioned wanting to do labs. I''ll email her and let her know to contact the Concierge Team to access any labs she wants. The just did their taxes and wound up paying $7K back in taxes bc their income was double what they expected. Her account shows $43K or close to that. Mark said they put in $65K but in reality it''s double the $65K meaning about $130K. I got permission from them to cancel their Anthem plan and sent them the proof of cancellation via email while on the phone with them. They are thrilled to be done with Anthem and are happy to have the flexibility of benefits and virtual healthcare app, etc. Also glad to know they won''t be speaking with a Dr. in India on the app. I let them know the Drs. have to be based in the US. They are excited to move to this model. Chose Premium Care at $1500/$254 and $125/$25. Super nice!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-19 10:47:54', '2025-02-19 10:47:54'),
