  ('zcrm_1579374000159718195', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159766045', 'Douglas Rundell', NULL, '2-18-25 Douglas called bc he received a letter from C4 to show proof of his income. He uploaded his taxes from last year. But, that showed $54K and he expects closer to $43,320 since much of last year''s income was from tons of overtime work where he gets paid $36 per hour instead of $24 per hr. He will upload his last two pay stubs which show 5-10 extra hours of overtime. The $43, 320 is guessing he gets an extra 10 hrs per month. I updated his income from $39K to the $43,320 and it increased his monthly cost from $25 to $50 per month since he''s supporting 2 kids as well. He is keeping his plan. He came to me via Bev.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-18 17:10:50', '2025-02-18 17:10:50'),
