  ('zcrm_1579374000159719130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156186015', 'Noah Burleson', NULL, 'Noah called in and at first couldn''t get his password reset but then was able to on the computer when I provided his ID number. 2nd, his wife has an emergency surgery over the weekend and didn''t know how to do anything at the hospital. They haven''t been able to have their welcome call as of yet. I told him not a problem and how he would present himself being responsible for the first $2500 of their IUA. Everything after it to be submitted through zion health, which I put him over to them to get started. All set. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-18 13:04:48', '2025-02-18 13:04:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159719125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109789024', 'Sundiata Soon-Jahta', NULL, 'Got the info back from ARM that as long as the coding is preventative it will be processed. Relayed to Sundiata and he is all set. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-18 12:50:00', '2025-02-18 12:50:00'),
