  ('zcrm_1579374000159719105', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159677002', 'Stanley Treadaway', NULL, 'Just spoke to Carren and she has her daughter''s wellness appointment at 2pm in a few mins and they have no info to provider the doctor to submit and make sure everything is taken care of. I tried calling ARM but they were out to lunch. Apparently the hunsband has the card info and will provide his wife to give the doctor. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-18 12:01:16', '2025-02-18 12:01:16'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159718089', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899568', 'Stephanie Yost', NULL, '2-18-25 Stephanie is tending to an injury or something that she''s paying for on her own that won''t reach her IUA. So, she''s ok with switching to Premium Care to bring down her cost substantially from $419 to $285. The MEC is worthless bc the network is non existent in HA. She will consider HAB to add possibly soon. She wants to think it over. She''s also looking at ACA but will see how brutal those plans are. Her income is far less than normal and than she wants bc of a biz she''s working on growing. She did her mammo and colonoscopy this year already and has no need to do either any time soon. She does want to do the other traditional well checks. She completed the conversion form from MPB CareZ to  Premium Care $1000/$285 for March 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-18 11:58:36', '2025-02-18 11:58:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159711058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366030', 'Veljko Ilic', NULL, 'Member called in wanting to cancel.  I let him know to be in contact with his advisor and that I would send him out the link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-18 11:57:33', '2025-02-18 11:57:33'),
