  ('zcrm_1579374000159719003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156744038', 'David Descoteaux', NULL, 'David called in and said that he had to cancel his annual physical that I scheduled for him due to the time being too late in the afternoon. He said he has always had this problem going to his provider for over 20 years and that it would be easier for him to schedule this specific appointment himself online. But other types of appointments we can do for him. I told him not a problem at all, he might have others coming up he will need help with. I told him to call when the time comes. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-18 07:14:25', '2025-02-18 07:14:25'),
