  ('zcrm_1579374000159676041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000060125007', 'Michael Remacle', NULL, '2-17-25 Kyle is still showing as  a dependent in C4. Hihlary received a notice asking for income info but they aren''t receiving an APTC. So, the only other thing I see wrong is Kyle as a dependent since I think they got him on Medicaid as a adult single tax payer. I left Hillary a vm just now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-17 17:34:24', '2025-02-17 17:34:24'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159676036', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154367025', 'Denise Kraal', NULL, '2-17-25 Denise is rethinking her C4 plan bc she''s having to pay back $7K from her last year''s taxes. Her income will show twice what she thought. She''s open to MCS and I sent her the video as well. We will talk tomorrow.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-17 16:47:14', '2025-02-17 16:47:14'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159676031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164537001', 'Brooke LeClaire', NULL, '2-17-25 Tax time enrollment information:

Coloradans can mark on their state tax return that they are uninsured and opt-in for their information to be shared with Connect for Health Colorado, the state''s health insurance marketplace, to find out whether they qualify for health coverage through Connect for Health Colorado or Health First Colorado (Colorado''s Medicaid program) or  Child Health Plan Plus (CHP+)


bullet
Coloradans must file by the April 15th* deadline to qualify for the 60-day Tax Time Special Enrollment Period through Connect for Health Colorado, but can enroll anytime through Health First Colorado (Colorado’s Medicaid program). We have free enrollment help available from certified experts to assist residents with applying and enrolling


bullet
To be eligible, Coloradans must not already be enrolled in a Marketplace plan and must qualify for financial help through Connect for Health Colorado', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-17 16:39:33', '2025-02-17 16:39:33'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159676026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011899568', 'Stephanie Yost', NULL, '2-17-25 Stephanie wants to review her options since her cost just went from $344 to $419. Money is tight and this isn''t sustainable. We will talk.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-17 16:17:45', '2025-02-17 16:17:45'),
