  ('zcrm_1579374000159685003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154687092', 'Laura Eckhardt', NULL, '02.17.25 - Spoke to Laura and explained we have no records of her interactions with us on Jan 15, she realized she called Sedera instead. Her advisor, Kirsten also provided her erroneous information on her start date. Reba will address with Kirsten and I will reach out to Sedera to see what kind of information was provided. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-02-17 13:05:44', '2025-02-17 13:05:44'),
