  ('zcrm_1579374000159665233', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153327002', 'Rachel Klobucher', NULL, 'Rachel called to see if her provider is in the PHCS network, she though this appointment wasn''t going to be covered when in fact it is and the provider in network to top things off. She was very happy to hear this. I resent her digital ARM card that she got while on the phone with me. All set. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-17 12:59:43', '2025-02-17 12:59:43'),
