  ('zcrm_1579374000159665201', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152321002', 'Zachary Lamkin', NULL, 'CALLED AND SPOKE HIM. GOING WITH EMPLOYER SPONSORED PLAN FOR NOW. WILL LIKELY BE BACK AT THE END OF SUMMER. 

