  ('zcrm_1579374000159613041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000175078001', 'Christopher Parsons', NULL, '2-14-25 Chris called to provide DOB 11-17-25 and surgery date with Ortho CO Hospital was 11-6-23 and the billed amount is $62,876.65. He''s going to share MPB''s options at his Partner meeting on Tuesday of next week and will let me know when it will be a good time to meet with them.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-14 16:13:36', '2025-02-14 16:13:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159582102', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000159591007', 'Jaran Gray', NULL, 'Member Only $1000 IUA Secure', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-14 14:06:25', '2025-02-14 14:06:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159575260', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129638010', 'Douglas Merrifield', NULL, 'Doug called in and said from his wife''s stay at the hospital recently to which Doug said they have not gotten a single bill or statement from the hospital yet. Which I told Doug there are 6 months from the time the Need starts to be able to submit bills and have the sharing request Need started/opened up. I told Doug to get on top of the hospital the most he can until he get some form of a super bills/statement to start the sharing request before its too late making it ineligible to be shared at all. Once he gets some form of a bill to call us again and we will walk him through steps next. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-14 14:05:59', '2025-02-14 14:05:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159613026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065038076', 'Willow Aureala', NULL, '2-14-25 Willow is asking again why she was charged $350 recently when she cancelled in Dec. and re-enrolled in Premium Care for $234. I spoke with Patti and she will refund the difference in price bc MPB missed the cancellation form that she submitted on 12/3/24. It was not her fault. Thankfully Patti will resolve!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-14 13:47:25', '2025-02-14 13:47:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159613021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151131001', 'Jackson Lebsack', NULL, '1-14-25 Spoke with Patti and she will refund one month since Jackson is getting ACA back to Dec. 1st, 2024 due to his low income. He turned 26 in Dec. If they hadn''t been proactive Patti would have just cancelled as of 1-1-25. But, they were trying to make sure he was protected and wound up with insurance and MPB by accident. I just spoke with Linda and she was very appreciative of everyone''s help. She''s very pleased with MPB and Jackson will likely re-enroll once his income increases significantly. She is very, very thankful!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-14 13:45:32', '2025-02-14 13:45:32'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159582097', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129828002', 'Emma Donovan', NULL, 'Emma requested a card be mailed to her will put in a request. AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-14 13:33:55', '2025-02-14 13:33:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159582092', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000031359289', 'Jorge Zatarain', NULL, 'This member was originally under spouse Maribel Orozco I have changed in both CRM &amp; A123 to match Sedera''s records.  Should be fixed now', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-14 13:32:30', '2025-02-14 13:32:30'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159582079', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151131001', 'Jackson Lebsack', NULL, 'This member never submitted the cancellation after they went on the ACA.  They finally submitted cancellation on 2/14.  I explained to Wendy that if we refund that we are out the money and that her members need to be more responsive and involved.  I will cancel eff 2/25.  I will only refund this because parents are still members', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-14 13:17:20', '2025-02-14 13:18:01'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159623003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000027993452', 'Holly Wiese', NULL, '2.14.25 - Holly mentioned that someone on the Concierge told her to present her insurance card instead of cash pay. In return, she received a greater bill. The call in question took place on Dec 27th, however I did not see a call on Dec 27th on call reports that would reflect this information. Holly may have called the MEC provider (either Plansin or ARM), since she was told that if she did not present her card, she would not get reimbursement. Asked Holly to check the number she dialed for further clarity. She may also be able to get a PPO discount. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-02-14 13:16:50', '2025-03-04 10:36:27'),
