  ('zcrm_1579374000159613016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000138597002', 'Bladimir Aviles', NULL, '2-14-25 Bladimir called bc he''s having pain in his stomach again. I instructed him to start with CirrusMD. He also has an open need already for this. I suggested he figure out who his contact person is with Zion and to ask for instructions moving forward is CirrusMD can''t help. He''s already paid his $1000 IUA and Zion shared above that. His last incident was a few months ago. So, the Need should be open still for sharing but I want him to get confirmation from Zion as a safety measure. He understood.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-14 12:50:49', '2025-02-14 12:50:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159575228', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129828002', 'Emma Donovan', NULL, 'Emma called in having an issue with a recent preventative MEC appointment and the provider stating when he/she was putting in Emma''s Member ID number on the digital ARM Card, which is just OUR Admin123 member ID number. I explained to her that the provider needs to have entered in the group number right below that and submit claims to the claims address right next on the other side right side of the digital card she has. She understood what she needs to do to make sure her provider submits to ARM at the right place. Prev. Colonoscopy and already knows in PHCS Network. All Set for now. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-14 12:50:02', '2025-02-14 12:50:02'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159575223', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141240002', 'Michael Greene', NULL, 'Both Mike & Amy called with several different questions. Regarding a broken ankle that Mike had encountered back in Oct. a few months ago, which he said is much better now. He assumed it was through ARM that he submits everything through. They were unaware of the different aspects of their plan with preventative and diagnostic. I explained in depth the differences, presenting of oneself, scheduling for prev. ARM appointments, etc. I told them to where they were fully understanding and no longer in the unknown. They are happy and all questions answered. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-14 12:46:40', '2025-02-14 12:46:40'),
