  ('zcrm_1579374000159613008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151131001', 'Jackson Lebsack', NULL, '1-14-25 Linda called bc Jackson is being charged still and she thought it was already cancelled. They had wanted to back date it to Dec. 1st but we were already into Dec. So, she left it alone. However, she didn''t realize she needed to complete the cancellation form to end it for good. She just completed the form now. But, they were able to get him on ACA plan due to his income at about $26K and a huge APTC. So, he was double covered and never wanted to be. He can''t afford another $234 a month! I will speak with billing. UGH!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-14 11:47:48', '2025-02-14 11:47:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159613003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099710012', 'Shane Lebsack', NULL, '1-14-25 Linda called bc Jackson is being charged still and she thought it was already cancelled. They had wanted to back date it to Dec. 1st but we were already into Dec. So, she left it alone. However, she didn''t realized she needed to complete the cancellation form to end it for good. She just completed the form now. But, they were able to get him on ACA due to his income at about $26K and a huge APTC for Jan. 1st. So, he was double covered and never wanted to be. He can''t afford another $234 a month! I will talk with Patti. UGH!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-14 11:46:14', '2025-02-14 11:49:55'),
