  ('zcrm_1579374000159582029', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000120891002', 'Douglas Hill', NULL, 'Member called in to Concierge and I called him back.  He told me that he now had a job and his employer was offering him an Limited Benefit Indemnity Plan.  He explained to me how it works and asked if MPB could be secondary as it had no benifits for Catastrophic.  I told him that could work since the need would be opened by him.  He also wanted to increase his IUA since he will be paying for other coverage.  I will send him Change Form.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-14 11:12:39', '2025-02-14 11:12:39'),
