  ('zcrm_1579374000159544003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000079563002', 'James Lee', NULL, '02.13.25:  Jim called last evening and I returned his call today. He said he was disappointed to recently learn from Zion that since he and Laurie switched from Secure w/Zion + Planstin Mec to Direct w/Zion''s preventive care package, Zion told him they would have to wait 6 mos. to use their preventive care. So Laurie can not have her colonoscopy until July.  Also Zion is looking into whether Jim can have his colonoscopy as a preventive service or if, due to a possible pre-x condition, he would have to open a need w/Zion and pay an IUA.  He is willing to accept this if absolutely required but was hoping he could get his first colonoscopy w/Zion as a preventive service.  Jim is waiting to hear back from Zion. I told him I would look into this a well. JSP', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-13 13:28:53', '2025-02-13 13:28:53'),
