  ('zcrm_1579374000159385093', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012051083', 'Nancy Gentry', NULL, '2/12/25: Nancy called with a couple of questions. She wanted to know if she can get a mamm annually per dr recommendation even though the benefit letter from ARM states every 2 years. We also looked up options for where she can have this done. It looks like Boulder Community Health is in network - I advised her to call up there and have them verify her benefits to be certain. I spoke with Monica at ARM about the mamm frequency and confirmed that it would be covered if dr suggested she do it annually - sent Nancy this info in writing via email (see for more details). AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-12 12:12:15', '2025-02-12 13:25:49'),
