  ('zcrm_1579374000159405018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000164537001', 'Brooke LeClaire', NULL, '2-12-25 Brooke is self-employed and without Medicaid since spring of 2024. No SEP except Tax Time Enrollment. I sent her the instructions from C4 to send to her accountant as a guide. The Tax Time Enrollment doesn''t show up this year. Looks like a different process of pre-approval before anyone is allowed to go that route. She''s guessing her income will be about $25K with her contract work and self-employment. She ended her other W2 job a while back. Lives in Longmont. When she''s approved for Tax Time Enrollment she will get about a $799.96 APTC. But, she''s leaving the country on Sunday, Feb 16 - March 8th. She will let me know as soon as she knows anything from her accountant or gets approved from C4 to proceed. She can email me from abroad if need be. She''d like March 1st if possible since she doesn''t have any insurance now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-12 10:40:44', '2025-02-12 10:40:44'),
