  ('zcrm_1579374000159405003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000172169002', 'Patricia Beckvermit', NULL, '2-12-25 Trish is Teresa Howitt''s sister. Trish and husband are both 63. Husband is looking to retire soon, possibly in May or move to Part-Time or do consulting.  Trish watched the 9 minute video. They are pretty healthy, only issue is husband has acid reflux and takes a med as well as one for sleep. He does an endoscopy every 2-3 years and colonoscopy every 3 years or so due to family history. No tobacco and no other pre-x for either of them. However, Trish has dense breasts and usually needs the follow up ultrasound. I explained that''s not included with Premium Care or Premium HSA but it is with HAB. She is interested in HAB as well, especially for dental, vision, skin check, mammo and follow up, additional IUA, etc. She''s also curious about Premium HSA for the tax benefits. Will try to run some numbers to see what makes sense. I told her to reach out in early April if retiring by May 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-12 09:51:45', '2025-02-12 09:51:45'),
