  ('zcrm_1579374000159267023', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065014004', 'Carrie Ballas', NULL, '2-11-25 Carrie is interested in Premium Care. She''s 49 and has some osteoarthritis in her knees that she plans to deal with for life on her own. Did some PRP that she just paid for bc it was too complicated to get reimbursed. She also considered or did hyularonic acid injections. Never dealt with reimbursement for anything. She knows the new pre-x clause. Otherwise, she really only does mammo and colonoscopy and I let her know the 6 month wait and $600 and $2500 caps on each. Thinking over Premium Care $285/$1000 and $107 HAB.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-11 12:22:35', '2025-02-11 12:22:35'),
