  ('zcrm_1579374000159321003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000089149002', 'Daniel Connelly', NULL, '02.11.25 Received an advisor ticket with a concern that MPB.Health told the member that only certain preventive labs are covered, and not the ARM preventive coding rule. Listened to the only call Cynthia had on 01..2.5 where preventive care was not discussed, and did not see in the CRM emails any communication that would indicate the older (Planstin) information. Cynthia also has bills from her preventive care that she would like to obtain reimbursements on. Will reach out to the Concierge to provide the member with guidance. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-02-11 10:26:18', '2025-02-11 10:26:18'),
