  ('zcrm_1579374000159282159', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035227111', 'Jeffrey Parker', NULL, '2/11/25: Jeff called saying he just got a bill from a physical he got in Feb of last year. As we were talking it sounds like he already received an EOB from RCI stating what they paid and didn''t pay for - so it might be that he is just a little late dealing with this and now getting another bill from provider. 
