  ('zcrm_1579374000159282101', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130129020', 'Lynne Turner', NULL, '2/11/25: Spoke to Lynne. She left BOB message: "She is seeking assistance with an appointment due to lower back pain. She is not sure if there is an in-network requirement.  She also needs physical insurance cards and the tax form sent to her. Alternate phone number is (508) 636-0160."

Sent request for physical cards through ARM portal. Asking Kelly to send physical MPB cards.
Spoke at length about presenting for appts and submitting sharing request for upcoming issue with her back pain. Ended up transferring to Zion to open member portal. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-11 09:17:34', '2025-02-11 09:17:34'),
