  ('zcrm_1579374000159283027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000157411021', 'Mark Stevens', NULL, 'PLEASE PUT ALL NOTES IN MEMBERS OTHER CONTACT EFF 1/1/25.  THAT HAS ALL NOTES', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-11 08:59:53', '2025-02-11 08:59:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159282086', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011521138', 'Jamie Solow', NULL, '2/11/25: Jamie called just wanting us to be aware of an incident and medical need his wife is going through. He''s already opened sharing request and been in contact with Zion regarding it. 

His wife had an accident and they did surgery to implant a stabilizing brace in her bone. They couldn''t do the surgery on the leg because of the swelling. She has tibial plateau fracture and they emitted her because she has an infection in her leg, and she has to have the surgery to repair the leg. Dr. Segina from Health First Holmes medical in Melbourne is where she is. He named Mpower as someone who has access to her medical records. Dr. Orr did the first surgery in Barton memorial hospital in Nevada.

I let him know that he is doing everything correctly, and we would be in touch throughout the process to ensure everything goes smoothly. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-11 08:57:29', '2025-02-11 08:57:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159282081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154906001', 'Cary Davis', NULL, '2/11/25: Called Lylia back, BOB message:"She needs to attend her preventative appointment but she is stating she doesn''t have an insurance card for that type of care so she asked how is she supposed to handle this appointment. She would like for you to leave a voicemail with the information she needs since she will be at her appointment at the time of your call and she needs that information for her appointment."
Left her a detailed VM letting her know that I put in a request to have her card sent out today and will touch base with her once I receive and email it. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-11 08:46:19', '2025-02-11 08:46:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159282076', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125115002', 'Kenneth Arnold', NULL, '2/11/25: BOB Message: "His wife went to a wellness check up, and they told her that their coverage ended on December 1st. He stated that this should have been renewed automatically, and he would like to speak with you regarding this."
Called and spoke with Kenny. Advised him to present ARM card to provider and have them send the claim there. Requested 2 physical cards for him though portal. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-11 08:43:47', '2025-02-11 08:43:47'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159282069', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146503026', 'William Skabelund', NULL, '2/11/25: Called Sarah back and LVM - she left BOB message requesting physical cards for her family. I made the request to Dave via email to have 5 cards mailed out to them. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-11 08:35:04', '2025-02-11 08:35:04'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159297025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130263028', 'Mark Stevens', NULL, 'Called Mark, got the info I was requested to get with his Pharmacy &amp; Derm. facility he was trying to go to but was denied at the pharmacy with Rite Aid. He canceled said Derm, appt, due to fear of also being denied. I will do some research and digging to get this situated. Will update. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-11 08:34:11', '2025-02-11 08:34:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159282064', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000065366043', 'Jayne Asatani', NULL, '2/11/25: Jayne called wondering if her plan has outpatient benefits. She needs to be seen for a UTI. I explained that she would be presenting as self pay since this is not a prev appt and should the issue go over her IUA, then she can submit remaining costs for sharing. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-11 08:33:13', '2025-02-11 08:33:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159282059', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111395009', 'Eric Hove', NULL, '2/11/25: Emailed Aimee RX quote per request: 
I''m attaching a coupon for Generic Suprep for you based on your prescription quote request, however, I did call ARM and check to see if they cover this since it is a preventive medication for a colonoscopy. They let me know that YES, it is paid for through Citizens RX.
My advice is to use you ARM card at the pharmacy for this. 
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-11 08:21:44', '2025-02-11 08:21:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159297020', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105156012', 'Liju Kurian', NULL, 'Liju called in and just needed us to resend his digital ARM card. To which I did via email. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-11 08:21:08', '2025-02-11 08:21:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000159282046', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000127062001', 'Benjamin Madden', NULL, '2/11/25: Lindsay called. She injured her wrist and needs to see someone, wondering how it would work. We discussed IUA, presenting as self-pay, submitting estimates, opening Zion member portal, and collecting itemized receipts. Connected her to Zion to open member portal. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-11 08:19:55', '2025-02-11 08:19:55');
