  ('zcrm_1579374000158956003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000111395009', 'Eric Hove', NULL, '02.06.25 - ARM needs to know what type of Dr (Name, Specialty etc) and what the appointment is for to assist Aimee in insuring her facility of choice, Sutter Health/ Palo Alto Medical Foundation is able to accept the insurance for her appointment. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-02-06 07:34:01', '2025-02-06 07:34:01'),
