  ('zcrm_1579374000158861135', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136714002', 'Jana Miller', NULL, '2-5-25 From Jana, "Thanks!&nbsp; I did get hold of someone on the phone today (they never responded to my email).&nbsp; They said they don''t understand why it happened, but it looks like I''m good."  All set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-05 17:07:55', '2025-02-05 17:07:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158861130', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153961021', 'Patricia Lenz', NULL, '2-5-25 Patty is asking about a refund for Jan. $410 and Feb. $285. Per above, Patti couldn''t cancel for Jan. I gave Patty Lenz instructions to cancel for Feb. onward. Here''s my email sent on Jan. 6th, 2025 - 

Hi Patty,

Sorry to hear you are still trying to sort out what will work for you. For the Premium care membership, per the MPB Admin and Billing Department, they said you will have to cancel your plan now which will take effect Feb. 1st and then re-enroll once you are ready again. I can waive $100 of the $125 Admin/Set-up fee upon re-enrollment since you''ve already paid it!

You need to cancel before Jan. 19th to avoid being charged again. It will take effect for Feb. 1st. Then you need to re-enroll by the 19th of the month to be safe for the next month''s start date. If that''s on a weekend, then it will be the prior Friday. Or, just call me and I''ll explain. 

Here''s the link to submit your cancellation - https://mpb.health/cancel-membership/.

Cancel Membership - MPB Health - Health Sharing
Your membership has been a valuable part of our MPB Health Community, and we’d hate to see you go! Is there anything we can do to win you back? If you’ve made
mpb.health
As for your Health Access wellness benefits, I''ll let you know how they will handle your request as soon as I hear back from them.

Thanks,

Wendy Scipione

My comment about waiving the $100 is in reference to if/when she re-joins at a later date, not for this current enrollment since Patti B. can''t cancel retroactively.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-05 17:06:21', '2025-02-05 17:06:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158861125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000136714002', 'Jana Miller', NULL, '2-5-25 Jana is still struggling to reach Zion. They told her that she''s not an active member but MPB has confirmed she is Active. I told her to keep trying and to let me know if she doesn''t have success with re-opening the Need.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-05 16:53:13', '2025-02-05 16:53:13'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158848196', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000119704002', 'Jonmi Brunette', NULL, '2/5/25: Rick called and left BOB message: "He called as someone from Empowering Benefits was suppose to call him today regarding his wife Jonmi Brunette, but no one has reached out."
I let him know that we reached out via text and email - he said he had been responding to the text. 

Attempted to call Zion with him to have their prev colo sharing request reopened but got Zion''s voicemail. I let Rick know that I''d put a note in for us to call him in the morning to try again. Putting a reminder in teams. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-05 15:34:30', '2025-02-05 15:34:30'),
