  ('zcrm_1579374000158740091', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129026002', 'Michael Schmidt', NULL, 'Member has been trying to cancel this membership since 1/1/25.  Due to Advisor incompetence we did not get it.  I will email the link to the member.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-02-04 14:06:12', '2025-02-04 14:06:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158811013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012223122', 'Elizabeth Daly', NULL, '2-4-25 Elizabeth missed her window to re-enroll her daughter. So, I am requesting an active date of 2-1-25 for Keira from Sedera. If we get the thumbs up, I will have her complete the Premium Care membership app immediately, per Patti''s suggestion of this order of operations. Elizabeth had called MPB and Sedera and left vm''s on both systems but never connected with anyone to complete the process. I told her to call me if too much time has passed before I give her an update. Keira has some pre-x and we don''t want lapse in benefits. She has chronic cervical instability and face pain, etc. She will be moving to TN soon as well.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-04 14:04:02', '2025-02-04 14:04:46'),
