  ('zcrm_1579374000158640043', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000158712002', 'Kathleen Schofield', NULL, '2-3-25 Kathy was referred to me by Julie Perington. She''s 59 and lives in Broomfield. She left her job mid-Jan. Julie mentioned me many times in the past but she had no need for my services until now. She looked into Cobra and it will be $1100 a month and going onto her husband''s plan will be $1300 a month! She rarely goes to the Dr. She primarily goes for her annual wellness visits. She takes one HRT med called Bijuva and it looks to be $54 decent on Pharmacy Checker or $85 on GoodRX. Concierge can check all of the other options. Otherwise, no pre-x, no tobacco. We discussed Premium Care $1000/$285 and HAB $107 = $392. Even paying for her med she''ll save $600-$800 per month for EO. She enrolled right away for a March 1st start date. She can backdate Cobra if something comes up in Feb. She''s all set!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-02-03 21:36:04', '2025-02-03 21:36:04'),
