  ('zcrm_1579374000158635154', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100861002', 'Erin Dreistadt', NULL, 'Erin called in and said she wants to get her daughter a specific Tetanus shot, called TD not the TDAP (I believe that''s the correct spelling she said), but has been having no luck in finding any of the pharmacies allowing her to schedule an appointment due to her daughters age and recommending the other vaccine she doesn''t want to do. I suggested trying her primary care as dr. offices can order any vaccine. She will give them a try. -KF.', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-03 14:25:55', '2025-02-03 14:25:55'),
