  ('zcrm_1579374000158683049', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002630141', 'Cameron Elmendorf', NULL, '2/3/25: Emailed Cameron the following list of hematologist options:

Hi Cameron,

I''m writing to follow up on our conversation last week regarding your search for a provider to manage your anemia. I did my best to find options in Boulder, but you were absolutely right - Rocky Mountain Cancer Center has a strong presence in the area, and every hematologist I found is affiliated with them.
I spoke with them extensively, but unfortunately, they remain firm in their policy of not working with self-pay patients.

That said, I was able to find a few highly rated hematologists outside of Boulder:
Robert S. Kantor, MD (Hematology) – Brighton, CO | 303-232-0602
Yazan Migdady, MD (Internal Medicine, Hematology) – Denver, CO | 720-754-4800
Ajay Major, MD, MBA (Hematology & Oncology) – Denver, CO | 303-724-1788

I’d love to know where you currently have your iron infusion scheduled? Also, if you’re open to traveling outside of Boulder, I’d be happy to assist with scheduling an appointment. Just let me know how you’d like to proceed.

AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-03 14:23:47', '2025-02-03 14:23:47'),
