  ('zcrm_1579374000158587008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000082577024', 'Ross Rosen', NULL, '2/3/25: Ross called asking hypotheticals about his plan and what could be included within a sharing request. We discussed IUA amount, possible caps and expenses that can go under one issue - dr visits, imaging, surgery, rx, etc. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-03 07:59:45', '2025-02-03 07:59:45'),
