  ('zcrm_1579374000158587003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128525010', 'Paula Lueske', NULL, '2/3/25: Paula called and left message with BOB on Friday. "She would like to know if she has insurance and who is it through due to having a doctors appointment on Monday." She has already gone to the dr - I ended up educated her on new ARM MEC and clarifying the difference between Sedera and ARM. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-03 07:51:11', '2025-02-03 07:51:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158569021', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073212047', 'Luther Setzer', NULL, '2/3/25: Luther emailed in requesting physical ARM cards. Called arm and got 2 on the way. Replied back and let him know he should get them within 2-3 weeks. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-03 07:39:48', '2025-02-03 07:39:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158569016', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148931008', 'Im Sampen', NULL, '2/3/25: Im emailed in asking if RSV/COVID vaccines are covered. I replied back letting her know covid is but rsv is not and that she can get that at in network provider or though pharmacy other than cvs and walgreens. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-03 07:34:48', '2025-02-03 07:34:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158569011', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000128970002', 'Miguel Serra', NULL, '2/3/25: Catarina called asking for help finding dermatologist and/or podiatrist in network. I explained that there is no network for diagnostic related visits and searched HCBB. I wasn''t able to locate a derm, but gave her 2 options for podiatrist. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-02-03 07:29:40', '2025-02-03 07:29:40'),
