  ('zcrm_1579374000158462065', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000001746002', 'Ross Scatchard', NULL, '1-31-25 Ross called after talking to Patti. He''s getting new benefits with a job now for around $200 his cost and the employer is paying the rest. So, Patti had just sent him the cancellation form and is willing to allow him to cancel since he was 15 min. past the deadline. She will honor it. He''s all set and knows to contact me if anything changes.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-31 13:19:10', '2025-01-31 13:19:10'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158514003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109785001', 'Piotr Kaczmarowski', NULL, '1/31
Piotr called because he received a pill from Lab Quest and was determined he had done everything right and does not understand why he should pay 60$ , he told me that the provider had billed everything as diagnostic and he had the provider recode everything, we did a three-way call with planstin to see what happened and the rep explained that the provider sent over labs that are not preventative and these are usually diagnostic ex. hemoglobin,  complete CBC, immunoassay infections agent, comprehensive metabolic panel AC', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-31 13:08:19', '2025-01-31 13:08:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158501008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000141326004', 'Kara Smith', NULL, '01.31.25 - Kara stated Zion denied her preventive sharing request, because it''s not part of her plan. Passed to IT. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-01-31 12:45:19', '2025-01-31 12:45:19'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158501003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130802017', 'Bruce Maleski', NULL, '01.31.25 Sarah called stating her hospital Miss Family Breast Healthcare Center Trevor City MC/ Monson Healthcare 231.392.7102 was not sure how to bill ARM. Emailed ARM. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-01-31 12:09:06', '2025-01-31 12:09:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158462060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000062699001', 'Hilary Remacle', NULL, '1-31-25 "Connect for Colorado has wrong email and phone number- I’m on the phone trying to change. Also, Cigna said auto-pay went through today, so basically annoying for the alarm bells they issued for no reason.

Thanks for helping! 
Best, Hilary"', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-31 12:07:44', '2025-01-31 12:07:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158462055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154678360', '(James) Brent Penland', NULL, '1-31-25 Cigna is claiming termination due to non-payment but he doesn''t have a Cigna plan. He''s all set according to the above note.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-31 12:03:48', '2025-01-31 12:03:48'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158462047', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081505052', 'Tyler Dockstader', NULL, '1-31-25 I thought this was Bev''s client but he''s mine from 4 years ago. I called Tyler and he has ins through his work now with Anthem. The Cigna email about non-payment is weird. Looks like he had the $0 ped dental with Cigna years ago. Nothing is active. He''s all set and was nice.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-31 11:59:11', '2025-01-31 12:01:05'),
