  ('zcrm_1579374000158310120', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145822001', 'Angelika Hellmer', NULL, '01.30.25 - Angelika has knee pain, past sharing request has been denied due to pre-x. Has a new appt scheduled for 02.18.25 - advised it may still be a pre-x but to open a sharing request regardless. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-01-30 12:37:11', '2025-01-30 12:37:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158310115', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000145822001', 'Angelika Hellmer', NULL, '1-30-35 Angelika called bc she can''t reach the Concierge. She wants to know how to manage a new need. She got hit in the knees by her dog at the end of Oct. Sedera denied her new Need bc they deemed it pre-x due to osteoarthritis. She had a meniscus tear. That''s healing with PT and time, etc. Now months later, the pain in both knees is becoming bad again. I read the small section I could find in the Sedera Sharing Guidelines and let her know they will likely still deem it pre-x. However, the guidelines weren''t super clear. I suggested it''s worth a try to open a new Need. It will probably be denied. But, it can''t hurt to try. She will also call the Concierge for help with pricing out imaging or whatever else she needs. I let her know she will have $25K sharing once she reached Oct. 2025. She was very pleasant and understanding. She didn''t have the best experience with Savvos either. So, I told her the MPB Concierge Team can help her with pricing and quality care.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-30 12:34:20', '2025-01-30 12:34:20'),
