  ('zcrm_1579374000158151270', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002630141', 'Cameron Elmendorf', NULL, '1/29/25: Working through calling hematologists in Boulder and trying to find Cameron someone to manage her anemia. Rocky Mountain Cancer Center flat out refuses to work with self-pay or a healthshare, and EVERY hematologist in the area works there.
