  ('zcrm_1579374000158186125', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011659075', 'Snatam Khalsa', NULL, 'Snatam called in and said she wanted to know more if her plan would have any coverage for her daughter needing to see a nutritionist. I spoke with Patti since she has an older plan, we looked through the guidelines and couldn''t find anything specific to that. BUT Leo said he knows Catherine here has mentioned CirrusMD now has a nutritionist. I told Snatam I would get more info about this and reach back out to her tomorrow with a full answer and how to go about moving forward. Put follow up task in. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-29 14:15:44', '2025-01-29 14:15:44'),
