  ('zcrm_1579374000158151141', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137621001', 'Phillip Patterson', NULL, '1/29/25: Terri called. She was diagnosed with Bell''s Palsy and wants to make sure she is approaching her appts correctly. I let her know that yes, she is - and to continue collecting itemized statements. I educated her on how to open member portal and we discussed therapeutic treatments like acupuncture. Connected with Zion to open portal. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-29 09:06:03', '2025-01-29 09:06:03'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158168013', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605213', 'Allison Lemke', NULL, 'Per Julias Correspondence w/ Sedera - 

"The last time we spoke with Allison was on January 21st where she expressed her frustration of not being able to obtain itemized receipts from her providers. The MS advisor that took this call escalated this concern to Allison''s Need Coordinator and the NC emailed Allison to which we have yet to receive a reply to. 

This is what the NC emailed her:
"...Which provider are you struggling with to get the proper information from? There is a chance we can accept what you have already as long as it has the following things: Provider information (name, address, phone) Patient Name Date of Service(s) Itemized description of medical services rendered Original amount charged Discounts, if any Proof of patient payments, if any.
Let us know how we can further assist and guide you on how to navigate Sedera.

I don''t see any communication from us telling her that her Need was denied and I''m sorry if she misinterpreted that. 

It sounds like she may need extra hand holding on how to request itemization? I also dont see any attempts of new bill uploads. The last bill we have from her is from Aug 2024."', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2025-01-29 08:59:23', '2025-01-29 08:59:23'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158168008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000035605213', 'Allison Lemke', NULL, 'This member has been saved. We are intermediating everything with Sedera. Allison has scheduled a call for tomorrow with Acelyn to get everything submitted as well as gather any further missing bills.', 'Leonardo Moraes', 'Leonardo Moraes', '2025-01-29 08:55:18', '2025-01-29 08:55:18'),
