  ('zcrm_1579374000158151081', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000014855001', 'Tim Whitney', NULL, '1/28/25: Dona called needing her ARM card. Acelyn emailed it over. She also asked in thread if I could clarify their benefits (I''m sure she''s asking bc card only has Tim''s name on it - and if she can get reimbursed for shingles shot she got yesterday. I replied letting her know that everyone has the same benefits - Tim, Dona, Tim Jr and Nicholas, and that she can reach out to ARM directly to inquire about reimbursement but typically the provider needs to bill them directly. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-29 08:09:07', '2025-01-29 08:09:16'),
