  ('zcrm_1579374000158000060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129823144', 'Pam Adamson', NULL, 'Pam now wants to remove her spouse that she just added due to health issues that he is dealing with.   I spoke to Wendy and she advise me to just cancel him eff 3/25 due to late submission.  Spouse should not be on the Membership due to the following Health Issues:ALERT   Spouse: "complex sleep apnea", two heart murmurs, low level left ventricle (?) enlargement, right hip arthritus, naval area hernia, mild arthritus both knees, reactive gastropathy, neck whiplash, rt, shoulder stability problem, elbow displacement.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-01-28 12:59:27', '2025-01-28 12:59:27'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158038048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154707021', 'Kathleen Neben', NULL, 'Kathleen called in and had me check her new provider is in the network, which Dr. Megan Tucker IS in network. Then explained how she presents to front desk with her digitial ARM card. Got with Acelyn to have sent out her digital card. All set. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-28 12:58:36', '2025-01-28 12:58:36'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000158055028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000133981002', 'Michael Boyd', NULL, '1/28/25: Karen called wondering about Planstin and Vendor change. I educated her on the update and she was able to find new card in email. We discussed network, claims etc. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-28 12:55:07', '2025-01-28 12:55:07'),
