  ('zcrm_1579374000158004214', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153960002', 'Deziree Worster', NULL, '01.28.2025 Deziree put in a script request for Albuterol 1-3 inhalers (coupon ready to send) and Singulair 5mg, comes only as a chewable. I messaged Deziree via GoTo texts. to confirm that is exactly what her prescription is for - chewable 5mg.  NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-28 12:42:35', '2025-01-28 12:42:35'),
