  ('zcrm_1579374000158055018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000140542002', 'Julie Lehn', NULL, '1/28/25: Julie called. She broke her foot and is having surgery tomorrow. They are requiring her to pay upfront for the procedure. I advised her to just make sure she is collecting itemized receipts for everything and to go ahead an open her sharing request today. We discussed what she can include in it and how to submit estimates later if she need physical therapy etc. Gave her Zion''s number to call and open portal. Was going to connect her directly, but she had to take another call - She said she would call them today and open the request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-28 11:24:57', '2025-01-28 11:24:57'),
