  ('zcrm_1579374000158038005', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131710002', 'Scott Beaton', NULL, 'Just spoke to Elizabeth who was very distraught about her conversation she had yesterday with whom she spoke to here (Acelyn) yesterday 1/27/25.  I peeled her off the ceiling from being very confused and upset to happy and content. I clarified everything for Elizabeth, and she is happy with the outcome thanking me very much. Just a little confusion on how things are to be done. From what Elizabeth did with Planstin with paying out of pocket first, then SHE submitted the bills to Planstin to be reimbursed. I explained she can still do that, as long as the bills are coded preventative and in network. ARM doesn''t PREFER it that way, but we were told directly from Lori at ARM, however they get the bills, they will process the claims as long as coded correctly and in network. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-28 10:11:37', '2025-01-28 10:11:37'),
