Dear Jillian,  

I hope this message finds you well. I wanted to follow up regarding the two matters we recently discussed—your son’s mental health care and your scheduled colonoscopy.  

### Your Son’s Mental Health Care  
I’m pleased to let you know that your preferred provider for your son’s mental health care has been added to the network. You can now schedule an appointment by calling **1-800-543-5080**. I hope this provides some relief and allows you to proceed with the care he needs.  

