  ('zcrm_1579374000157528018', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000099051012', 'Angelica Valencia', NULL, 'Angelica called and she is having abdominal pains, throwing up blood, and thinks its some type of hernia. I told her she would be cash pay up to her IUA of $1000 IUA. She was parked outside the hospital and wanted more info. I told her she doesn''t need to wait and can go in and make sure she gets all the bills after she ONLY pays the IUA of $1000. Sending email with Zions info. -KF', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-23 07:12:35', '2025-01-23 07:12:35'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000157588003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000105482002', 'Dustin Nalley', NULL, 'I noticed that this member submitted the Change form to cancel membership.  I will send the link out to her.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-01-23 07:08:00', '2025-01-23 07:08:00'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000157532103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152891012', 'Valarie Jarvis', NULL, '01.22.2025 Camille called needing help in accessing her CirrusMD. I sent her a registration link. She was able to open her account and start a chat with a doctor. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-22 17:56:08', '2025-01-22 17:56:08'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000157532098', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000131740002', 'Anzhelika Siloyan', NULL, '01.22.2025 Spoke with Anzhelika. I asked about her sharing request. She said the following bullets:
- they opened the sharing request
- MPB accidently cancelled her membership (I dont see any notes on that)
- She has been reinstated and the membership is rectified.
- She is currently getting PT, as it needs to get done, but is clueless as to what is going on with the sharing request.
I suggested the following:
- Call the next day and do a way call with Zion
- Learn if there is a sharing request, is it open or is it closed.
Anzhelika is expecting us to call her on 01.23.2025 to facilitate the call with Zion. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-22 17:34:12', '2025-01-22 17:34:12'),
