  ('zcrm_1579374000157520060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000139143002', 'Jason Mitchell', NULL, '1/22/25: Jason called, said he spoke to Zion yesterday. Son still not showing up on their end. Let him know I''d put in another IT support ticket and follow up in a few days to see if it''s resolved. Letting the team know, set task for Monday. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-22 15:10:41', '2025-01-22 15:10:49'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000157550026', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130567002', 'Savannah Lewis', NULL, '1-22-24 Per the above note, I called Savannah to check in with her and left vm.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-22 15:07:22', '2025-01-22 15:07:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000157522028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000081707002', 'Christina Johnson', NULL, '01.22.25 - Christina called inquiring about her benefits. She had an appt with a derm, informed her that it would be out of pocket. But she could use telehealth to address her eczema in the future. Emailed member handbook and to schedule a WC. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-01-22 15:00:06', '2025-01-22 15:00:06'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000157520052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088688010', 'Caroline Jackson', NULL, '1/22/25: Caroline called back. I let her know that her account should be good now. We received news that everything is showing active on both ends. I was under the assumption that Caroline needed to open a new sharing request, BUT she has one active that she submitted back in Dec for an Oct ER visit for kidney stones. The request was denied due to "being inactive". 
We brought Zion into the call to request they reopen the sharing request and had to jump through all kind of hoops with them. The first girl wasn''t quite understanding the issue and finally passed us over to Caroline''s processor who said she needed to get this approved by her manager before moving forward. Kelly the processor assured Caroline that she would give her a call back either tonight or first thing tomorrow regarding this.
I apologized to Caroline for how difficult this has all been and urged her to give us a call if she doesn''t hear back.
Closed task and set a new one to check on Caroline next week. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-22 14:56:01', '2025-01-29 07:12:51'),
