  ('zcrm_1579374000157550008', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000150772201', 'Adlai McMahon', NULL, '1-22-25 Adlai had to waste 2 1/2 hrs this morning to change his daughter Betsy''s DOB in UHC system. RMHP had it correct, C4 it was correct but no UHC. He finally got RMHP and UHC to communicat together with him on the phone this morning to resolve the problem. He couldn''t get a med for his daughter bc of the typo for her DOB.  So, brutal. But, it''s all set thankfully!  I didn''t make any changes. I just confirmed the correct DOB. He confirmed and let me know it was all set already.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-22 14:01:53', '2025-01-22 14:03:29'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000157550003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000002630141', 'Cameron Elmendorf', NULL, '1-22-25 Cameron is running into a road block with getting a simple injection of iron (I think) and was sent to Rocky Mtn Cancer Ctr. They told her they won''t give her a cash price and won''t service her w/o insurance to bill.  I told her there''s a federal and CO state mandate to provide price transparency. Instead of fighting with them, I told her to call the Concierge Team for help in finding a better place to obtain this injection.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-22 13:56:52', '2025-01-22 13:56:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000157520044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000146983002', 'Katherine ann DUERKSEN', NULL, '1/22/25: Katherine called needing help with scheduling a colonoscopy. There are a few issues at play here. 1) She knows she is high risk and there is a good possibility it will be diagnostic. 2) She also has marketplace health insurance for one more month - so if it''s not "better" to use this plan for procedure, she can use the other insurance but would need to use it before the end of February. 

I need to touch base with Sedera and see if there are any other guidelines about colonoscopies - specifically age limits for screening colo sharing. Let Katherine know I would touch base with her on Monday. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-22 13:30:06', '2025-01-22 13:30:06'),
