  ('zcrm_1579374000157520003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156022002', 'Caleb Day', NULL, 'There was a ticket submitted because the spouse is a smoker, however due to limitations of A123 this did not show up on the application, therefore they were not charged extra $50.  I will increase price by $50 in A123 and Aba will notify Layton at Planstin.', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-01-22 12:34:51', '2025-01-22 12:34:51');
