  ('zcrm_1579374000157381025', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000046605028', 'Donald Spiegel', NULL, '01.21.25 Bobbi (provider) is helping Donald with the sharing request since he is not computer savvy. Explained that IUA is based on needs, and carries over to the new year assuming it is associated with the same sharing request. He will pay the IUA directly with Zion, portal is already open. Bobbi will call Zion and let them know of an upcoming appt for $3000 that needs to be paid prior in order for him to continue. Advised to call Zion directly to coordinate with their medical advocacy/sharing team. JA', 'MPB Health Member Notification', 'MPB Health Member Notification', '2025-01-21 09:56:20', '2025-01-21 09:56:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000157348103', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000126941002', 'Dana Reilley', NULL, '1/21/25: Dana called wanting to add preventive services to her plan. I let her know she already had preventive services and explained about ARM, the welcome letter, in network providers, and how to present at appts. She''s going to review the email. Let her know if she needed any more help or had additional questions, to call us. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-21 09:54:28', '2025-01-21 09:54:28'),
