  ('zcrm_1579374000157394003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000064414873', 'Jillian Livingston', NULL, '1-21-25 Jillian called bc she was totally confused. She needs her son Axel to have psychotherapy. She thought that she does that through Planstin. I told her that''s through Life Care with MPB. She got his therapist into the network a while back. I also let her know he has up to $3000 with HAB for mental health reimbursements. Next she''s going in for a colonoscopy tomorrow and wants to make sure it''s all set. However, she on the 3 year plan now that they found polyps 3 years ago. I told her they might automatically consider this visit as diagnostic which means she has to pay the first $1K and then Zion shares as a new Need. She wound up paying about $10K last time bc it turned to diagnostic and she was a new member!!  She will do whatever is necessary to avoid this!! She will call the MPB Concierge Team now.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-21 09:21:36', '2025-01-21 09:21:36'),
