  ('zcrm_1579374000157348073', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000151449002', 'Betsy Todd', NULL, '1/21/25: Called Betsy and she called back. I wanted to clear up some things regarding the email she sent. Seems like there might be some confusion.
1. physical card she wants by tomorrow. I explained (for the third time) ARM mails these out and to check mail status or request rush shipping, she''d have to ask them directly. (transferred at end of call)
2. Submitted a sharing request 2.5 weeks ago and hasn''t heard back. I explained that unfortunately, Zion is in their busy season and processing of requests take 4-6 weeks. Advised her to give it a while longer, and if she still doesn''t hear from them, to let us know and we can escalate the issue.
3. Doctor is requesting "preventive" breast MRI. I explained that I''m 99% sure ARM does not pay for MRIs or breast ultrasounds for that matter - only Mammograms -so the MRI would be self pay and if the issue exceeded $1000, she could submit as separate Request through Zion. To give her peace of mind, suggested she clarify with ARM while discussing status of physical card. Set FU for 2 weeks. 

Betsy called back, saying that this plan is too complicated and she wants to cancel and be reimbursed for February. Sent her cancellation form, and transferred to Patti to discuss reimbursement. Reaching out to Leo. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-21 08:53:53', '2025-01-21 09:08:56'),
