  ('zcrm_1579374000157280003', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000125339002', 'Suzanne Hughes', NULL, '1/20/25: Suzanne emailed in (replying to ARM card email) asking if there is an insurance card for prescriptions. Replied back with this:

