  ('zcrm_1579374000157169203', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000055057166', 'Karen Sherry', NULL, 'Member called in after hours and requested cancellation eff 2/25.  I will notify Wendy &amp; send out cancellation link', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-01-20 06:51:46', '2025-01-20 06:51:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000157241060', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000037657007', 'Mary Evans', NULL, '1-17-25 Mary decided to convert from Secure HSA to Premium Care and HAB. She will find out if she can fund her HSA for 2024 via her accountant. She can also add the $1000 as 55+ and possibly as family since her daughter was also a member. She''s excited to join Premium Care and HAB bc she will save $28 per month, remove networks limitations and add dental, vision, gym, skin checks that she didn''t have otherwise. She has no pre-x, only well checks and nothing has shown up at all. She''s 62. He daughter was just removed from her membership for Jan. 1st.  Now with Premium Care $1000/$285 and HAB $107 her total is $392. She''s very happy that we got this completed for Feb. 1st.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-17 19:54:53', '2025-01-17 19:54:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000157192212', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000100491002', 'Michelle Faciana', NULL, '01.17.2025 Followed up with Michelle via concierge email. Closed task. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-17 17:48:31', '2025-01-17 17:48:31'),
