  ('zcrm_1579374000157192188', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000137826002', 'Michael Gelfeld', NULL, '01.17.2025 Michael left us a VM. I called him back and left him one, responding briefly to his inquiry about psychiatry. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-17 16:52:44', '2025-01-17 16:52:44'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000157192183', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000010331041', 'Karen Tips', NULL, '01.17.2025 Karen called after she came back from the pharmacy and them telling her that her benefits have been discontinued.
I assured her that her membership is still ongoing, and explained the CHANGE ( they have not received any information about the change in MEC, nor have we received their virtual card).
I put her on the list of members with missing cards on the excel sheet. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-17 16:39:53', '2025-01-17 16:39:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000157241042', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000165772002', 'Harper Phillips', NULL, '1-17-25 Harper came to me via Ashley Sargent (Davenport). Harper is still living in VT, I think in Waterbury area. He''s paying $900 on the VT exchange this year for a $5K ded crappy plan. He said it went up from $600+ in 2024. He did his colonoscopy last year and all was well. No pre-x, no meds, no tobacco. I discussed Premium Care until I just realized now that it''s not allowed in VT. I just sent him a note and new pricing. It''s still half of what he''s paying right now. He might benefit from the supplement discounts. He no longer gets a ski pass and just does back country skiing instead. He goes hunting for deer and birds in the fall and winter now as well. He just did a wellness visit for the first time in forever last year. He said Yes to the following for HAB, skin check, wellness check, dental, vision, labs and no to gym, mental health, nutrition. There is NO ACA tax penalty in VT at this time. I just double checked and nothing has changed for 2025. So, Care+ $1000/$352 and HAB $107 = $459 will be best since Premium Care won''t work in VT. He will watch the video even though I also explained it all to him. He will read the overview and knows of the deadline on Monday. He''ll call me after he reviews it all this weekend.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-17 16:13:23', '2025-01-17 16:14:53'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000157192170', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647172', 'Julie Perington', NULL, '01.17.2025 Spoke with ARM, they confirmed that they received the list of members who still need ARM cards. 
Dave Mitchell sent me her virtual card, and I emailed it to her via CRM email. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-17 16:12:33', '2025-01-17 16:13:55'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000157192155', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000153190001', 'Pamela Harrel', NULL, '01.17.2025 Pamela called to learn if she needs to attain any information from us, regarding her membership, to make sure everything is up and running. We went over the MPB Portal elements: schedule a welcome call, Calling the concierge, forms and services. 
Has not received a fulfillment package. 
