  ('zcrm_1579374000157192150', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155319028', 'Michael Redding', 'CONTACT Shelly on: 7202775301', '01.17.2025 Shelly called back saying she might have a referral from a friend, and to hold off on searching for physicians on our part. She will get back to us on whether to proceed 
Did get a packet from Sedera, Shelly is thinking it is the initial package from them. She will message us to confirm it was indeed from Sedera and not MPB. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-17 15:44:20', '2025-01-17 15:44:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000157241037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109184005', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, '1-17-25 Merrly enrolled in Premium Care $285/$1000 and HAB $107 = $392 which is far better than $726.54 for full price Cigna. She also understands we didn''t change her income on C4 bc she had already paid in Dec. for Jan. Now Feb. onward is cancelled. So, if she has a tax penalty, at most it will be $152.80 from 1 month. She was very happy with how easy I made it for her. These things overwhelm her and I let her know she has the Concierge Team for Premium Care, me for HAB and anything else she needs. I let her know I''ll help her with all aspects, if need be.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-17 15:43:12', '2025-01-17 15:43:12'),
