  ('zcrm_1579374000157192145', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000012578137', 'Rachel Fisher Ingraham', NULL, '01.17.2025 Instead of a mammogram - going straight to an ultrasound - ARM deemed it as preventive routine as long as it''s the ultrasound only NOT the mammogram AND the ultrasound.
