  ('zcrm_1579374000157169182', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109186002', 'Zachary Larson', NULL, '1/17/25: Zach called with some questions regarding his sharing request. He''s having a colo and hernia repair done at the same place, same surgeon (and during the same time I think). Wondering how to submit sharing requests when some documentation pertains to both procedures. I brought Zion in on the call and Jade instructed him to go ahead and submit an additional sharing request and she would make a note in there about the documentation. She also mentioned that Zion would only share the colo if it is diagnostic. 
Zach''s appt is for the end of Feb, and hospital is requiring half payment upfront in order to save the date for his appt. I advised to go ahead and submit the next sharing request asap and as much documentation as he can. There''s already a task in there by Acelyn. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-17 14:36:19', '2025-01-17 14:38:01'),
