  ('zcrm_1579374000156942084', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000109184005', 'Merryl Rothaus', NULL, '1-15-25 We updated her account. She''s totally done with supporting the traditional insurance companies. She went to get her hypo thyroid medication and it went from $21 to $77! Nobody could give her an explanation of why. She couldn''t find out the price of her plan. She won''t qualify for a subsidy and the full cost is over $724!  She''s done with it. I looked up Cytomel and found it for $21, $25, $28, Not $70+. She has a foot surgery 2 years ago which is why she switched off of MCS. That''s completely done and no more problems. She takes psychiatric meds as well. We discussed Premium Care and HAB. I refreshed her memory about the pre-x clause and she''s OK with it. She mentioned loving Cloud Medical also which is $139 per month. She could have Premium Care $285/$1000, HAB $107 and Cloud Medical $139 all for less than $724 per month. She'' actually thinking of just doing Premium Care and HAB. She can also make use of the mental health counseling, dental, wellness, etc.  We will revisit in a day or two.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-15 19:49:26', '2025-01-15 20:54:53'),
