  ('zcrm_1579374000156891030', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129524001', 'Kathryn Jarrett', NULL, '1/15/25: Kathryn called - or rather was transferred from Planstin. She said that planstin told her she wasn''t a member with them anymore and we had her plan. I clarified for Kathryn that she''s always been an MPB member and planstin is only a small part of ther MCS plan - and educated her on the vendor change. 
Resent her ARM card to her, checked her derm on multiplan with no luck, advised her to call the office to check network before going in. 
Member mentioned she has several dr appts scheduled this month so make sure to mention that in followup and offer appt setting help. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-15 09:05:13', '2025-01-15 09:06:23'),
