  ('zcrm_1579374000156759134', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156781406', 'Megan Ila', NULL, '1-14-25 Megan already joined insurance for 2025 without my assistance but realizes she needs dental ins and couldn''t understand the options on C4. I gave her the 1dental option instead. She and her husband aren''t tied to any dentist. They have been using River Valley Dental and Community Dental. Her husband just got an implant last year which was not a normal year. Otherwise they have healthy teeth. I sent her the link and she will ponder and join when ready.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-14 19:43:29', '2025-01-14 19:43:29'),
