  ('zcrm_1579374000156738315', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000152854002', 'Arlene Thomas', NULL, '1/14/25: Arlene called wondering how to get her statin medication. I advised her to see her PCP or she could try Cirrus although I''m not sure if they prescribe that. Tried to register her for Cirrus and got error - no records found. Emailed Cirrus a support ticket.
Arlene also asked about her hsa account. I let her know she can contribute to the account she has set up, this plan simply qualifies her to continue making contributions. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-14 17:30:46', '2025-01-14 17:30:46'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156759114', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000054286250', 'Sean Barrett', NULL, '1-14-25 Sean called and has decided he wants to try US Health bc they have a $2500 ded and he''s not super excited about IUA per incident. I let him know my concerns and what I''ve heard about US Health. He just wants to try something different for now. He may come back but he''s moving on for the moment. Sent him the cancellation form.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-14 16:52:11', '2025-01-14 16:52:11'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156738307', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000132035001', 'John Tagle', NULL, '1/14/25: Resent ARM card email per Julia''s request, and called John to make sure he got it. -rcvd. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-14 16:25:54', '2025-01-14 16:25:54'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156759109', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000005291752', 'Christine Harvey', NULL, '1-14-25 Christine completed the change form from Secure HSA to Premium Care and completing the app for HAB for Feb. 1st, effective. Premium Care $285/$1000 and $107 HAB = $392.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-14 16:19:39', '2025-01-14 16:19:39'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156738290', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130567002', 'Savannah Lewis', NULL, '1/14/25: Called Savannah and did a 3 way with Zion to get the status of her sharing request. We spoke to Ulyses who could not confirm that Savannah had paid her IUA. Savannah stated that the first 4 statements uploaded prove they''ve paid $1,040 - additionally, she''s uploaded 4 more bills totaling over $2,000. Ulyses put us on hold to find a manager to look at the account, and after 15 minutes, came back and said the manager would be calling us back in a few (about 10 minutes). 
As I''m writing this, it''s been over 20 minutes and no call from Zion. 

Savannah already felt frustrated by how difficult it has been to work with Zion. When I first called, they wouldn''t speak to me stating that she didn''t fill out the PHI form correctly - She put her spouse and herself on the form where Ulyses said she only should put her name on it. -It was then that I brought Savannah into the call. 
Prior to even getting to the form, Zion wouldn''t speak to her until she presented her ID number claiming they could not verify her info with her name, DOB or email since I used those pieces of information when I called. He stated we could either hang up and call again (ridiculous!) or she needed to provide her Zion ID number. Thank goodness Savannah did eventually find the number.

Called Zion back - since I never heard from a manager. I was told that they took it upon themselves to call and speak directly with the member instead of calling MPB due to Hippa compliance -  (even though Ulyses confirmed they would call MPB so we could all discuss request.) Then I was told that they can''t give me any info bc Savannah only gave me permission to speak about herself - not Trevor, who the sharing request is for. HOWEVER, no one thought that was important to mention when she was resubmitting the PHI form while we were on the phone. 
AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-14 16:13:00', '2025-01-14 17:07:21'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156738285', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000107629002', 'Bryan McCay', NULL, '1/14/25: Bryan called having trouble scheduling an appt bc the provider doesn''t recognize MPB or ARM - but they are in the PHCS network. I advised to call back and if the front desk clerk needs to verify - have them call ARM. Otherwise, we are available to call for him and make an appt. He said he''d give it another try. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-14 16:04:52', '2025-01-14 16:04:52'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156759104', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000073002105', 'Tonya Allen', NULL, '1-14-25 Tonya has firm and confident in her decision to cancel. She will be taking care of her health on her own now moving forward. She doesn''t want anything at all. She was very nice and appreciative but clear she doesn''t want anything. I''m sending her the cancellation form to complete.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-14 15:59:58', '2025-01-14 15:59:58'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156738278', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000148931008', 'Im Sampen', NULL, '1/14/25: Sent FU email to Im to see if the RX coupons I provided were helpful. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-14 15:54:51', '2025-01-14 15:54:51'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156759099', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156781316', 'Danny Fulton', NULL, '1-14-25 Finally, Danny wants vision but when I sent him the information, he wants to discuss it with his wife and possibly wait until they need glasses or for their next exam. He will keep the link I sent to join the VSP Plan A or Plan B when they are ready.  He was very appreciative of my help and the time I spent with him. He was shopping around and I helped him the most of anyone. So, he''s happy to have me as his agent. He let everyone else know and he cancelled his US Health plan for Jan. 31st. He''s also a realtor and would love to price out my house any time just to see what it''s worth. I thanked him. He''s all set.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-14 15:53:07', '2025-01-14 15:53:07'),
