  ('zcrm_1579374000156747058', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000066577036', 'John Malloy', NULL, '01.14.2025 Dina called from Black Canyon medical center, on behalf of Elizabeth, regarding a colonoscopy screening. I verified Elizabeth''s information, and offered Dina, the rep who called, with vague insurance verification: "Yes she has benefits under the ACA guidelines for colon screening. She needs to call us for more guidance or we can do a 3way, It is important the facility bills the insurance directly and makes sure it is coded preventive." I will text Elizabeth to let her know the above details. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-14 10:34:28', '2025-01-14 10:34:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156845068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154712002', 'Donna Anglin', NULL, 'No response. Left a detailed message on vm. Sent email to reschedule welcome call. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-14 10:34:12', '2025-01-14 10:34:12'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156738210', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000097817002', 'Jennifer Hooker', NULL, '1/14/25: Jennfier called asking if she could get her annual/bloodwork done before a full calendar year. Her provider is wanting her to get bloodwork before annual visit. We called ARM - Dave verified that this is fine as long as it''s coded preventive and a part of her annual wellness checkup. We checked PHCS for her dr - who was not showing up but A LOT of other providers at that facility were. I advised Jennifer to just call her pcp and have them verify if they are in network. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-14 10:26:16', '2025-01-14 10:26:16'),
