  ('zcrm_1579374000156747041', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000134444002', 'Bonnie Nkrumah', NULL, '01.14.2025 Bonnie put in a Lab Quote Request. After searching on Laboratory Assist, the urine analysis was not populating. I took it out and everything else I put in populated with savings. I called Bonnie to get more clarification on what exactly is the analysis for, to see if I can use different terminology, and she too was stumped, b/c she did the search as well (it is the first one on the request lest), and nothing would come up for her. She gave me the green light to call and ask on her behalf, so I started with the Midwifery "Tree of Life" organization - (540) 318-0055. I ended up leaving a VM.
I called labcorp afterwards: (540) 373-9673. Ended up leaving a VM there as well. Both, requesting that they call back to offer more details on the Urine Analysis test that WHEN GOOGLED with all its acronyms attached, comes up with a variety of tests, cultures and analysis. 

Will send her the rest of the savings, before the end of the day, if I do not hear from either party. NT', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-14 09:39:50', '2025-01-14 09:57:32'),
