  ('zcrm_1579374000156759056', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000068476142', 'Michael Dee', NULL, '1-13-25 Mike called and texted bc he has his wellness visit tomorrow and wants to make sure he''s all set with the network with ARM. Apparently Nahla sent him a text letting him know he should be fine with ARM even though his Dr. isn''t showing up  now in the network ARM is supposedly going to honor it. I coached him to make sure everything is coded as preventive for the labs, if not access the additional ones through the Concierge. He''s happy with it all so far but doesn''t use it often. So, needs coaching every year he said. He will keep me posted if he runs into any problems. Going to Boulder Medical Ctr tomorrow for his visit.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-13 18:25:22', '2025-01-13 18:25:22'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156759048', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156829001', 'Jennifer McLemore', NULL, '1-13-25 Jennifer McLemore is 50, lives in Boulder and found me via Christine Harvey. She''s an acupuncturist and self-employed, Dragonfly Acupuncture, she''s healthy, no pre-x other then HRT taking estrogen Vivelle-Dot about $60 for brand or generic and trazadone for sleep. She was just dropped by Medicaid as of Feb. 1st, 2025. No tobacco, no drinking. She wants the $1000 IUA / $285 + $107 HAB = $392. She will use skin check, dental, vision, pap/well woman, blood/labs, gym, thermogram maybe. No for mental health. Yes, to supplements. She is all set for Feb. 1st, effective date. Super nice and appreciative.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-13 17:58:28', '2025-01-13 17:58:28'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156759038', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000156781087', 'Christopher Cook', NULL, '1-13-25 Chris 64 and Misako chose AC. They did not have the Naturalization A # necessary to complete the C4 application. They didn''t feel comfortable with MCS. They are happy with the larger PPO here and understand nothing is covered until they meet the $5K Ded each, except for wellness screenings that are included at no cost. They will remain on this until they each turn 65. They are both self-employed, so all set on that front.

