  ('zcrm_1579374000156759028', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000130567002', 'Savannah Lewis', NULL, '1-13-25 Savannah is having a brutal time with a Need for Trevor to get reimbursed. They have paid $3K+ for an ER visit, MRI and follow up visits. She was told visit an MPB Health chat that it was denied which doesn''t make sense. She uploaded the receipts in Sept. and hasn''t received anything from Zion. She feels like she''s left all alone in this process. She wants to get pregnant but is way too nervous to spend all of the money on the maternity for fear of not getting reimbursed. I re-explained how it''s supposed to work but she has been getting poor information all along fro everyone she talks with. She wasn''t told to obtain the itemized bill or Super Bill. She submitted what she had so far. She called the MPB Concierge just now and they told her they can''t help her either. I''m going to reach out to them myself to see if we can make progress. She wants to explore trad ins as well because she''s so unsure of this whole process that has been a bit of a nightmare from the get go.  Also, she kept trying to show her MPB card and everyone told her it wasn''t ins which made her upset. I explained that it''s not insurance and showing the card will make matters worse.  She''s starting to get an understanding. She was getting denied from getting the MRI since she didn''t have ins. I told her they can''t discriminate like that and have to be transparent with their cash price per state and federal rules.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-13 14:32:02', '2025-01-13 14:32:02'),
