  ('zcrm_1579374000156572031', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000129625123', 'Casey Zahorik', NULL, '1-10-25 Kim called re Case''s plan. She wants to keep it since they finally found some good doctors and staff to support Case with his horrendous dog bite. He was at a friend''s party and he''s known the dog for 5 years. However, when he plopped down on the couch, the dog literally bit his face off. The dog is likely a pit mix and swallowed part of his nose! He''s totally disfigured now and will need 4-5 plastic surgeries. He no longer has a septum in his nose. He had just had a rhinoplasty surgery before this happened. She thinks the dog smelled a strange smell from the surgery, hence why he bit his nose off. OMG!  They are going to get a lawyer to help pay for the surgeries, lost income, etc. She doesn''t want Medicaid anymore since the doctors they found likely won''t accept it. So, they will pay the deductible and hope they can work through the insurance to get this all done. His friends say he''ll never look the same again!', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-10 20:25:41', '2025-01-10 20:25:41'),
