  ('zcrm_1579374000156576037', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000116117002', 'Michael Griggs', NULL, '1/10/25: Tamara called asking how to find a list of in network doctors for well woman visit. I guided her to multiplan site and showed her how to search for a dr. Also offered the concierge appt service to her, but she said she would rather do it on her own. Will FU in a week to see if she was able to find dr. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-10 14:45:27', '2025-01-10 14:45:27'),
