  ('zcrm_1579374000156576027', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000098254002', 'Angela McGuire', NULL, '1/10/25: Angela called. The hospital she scheduled her colonoscopy with is wanting her to pay up front even though they are listed as being in the PHCS prac and anc network. I spoke to both ARM and Nothwestern hospital, and while ARM is willing to pay 150% of medicare rates for procedure, the hospital is charging $6400 for a cash pay rate. (150% of medicare is $2000). Given this info, I advised Angela to let us help her find a different place to have her colonoscopy and guided her to fill out the appt scheduling form. Emailed her this form as well per request. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-10 14:24:56', '2025-01-10 14:24:56'),
