  ('zcrm_1579374000156453088', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154714038', 'Mitchell Schroeder', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-10 10:37:59', '2025-01-10 10:37:59'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156489057', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610303', 'Lauren Rathbun', NULL, '1-10-25 Lauren wants to cancel and go to traditional insurance due to some new health issue. But, she doesn''t realize she''s facing much higher costs all around if she switches. She mentioned needing some psychological benefits that we don''t have. I let her know we have Life Care with 12 visits at no cost with a private network. She couldn''t share since she was in a public place at the moment. She thinks she wants traditional insurance but has no idea how terrible it is, unless she gets a huge subsidy. She''s pressured by the deadline. I let her know we can increase her IUA to lower her monthly as well. That seemed to help. I also mentioned HAB for the mental health without a network and that also spiked her interest. She will ponder.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-10 10:33:20', '2025-01-10 10:33:20'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156489052', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000011610303', 'Lauren Rathbun', NULL, '1-10-25 I left a vm at the main # and will call this one now (210) 862-1422.', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', 'Wendy Scipione - SR VP National Sales Advisor', '2025-01-10 10:22:40', '2025-01-10 10:22:40'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156453083', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000155097001', 'Rosanne Garza', NULL, 'Welcome call complete. Was not able to be on computer. Verbally went over plan details. Told her to reach out to us when she can to help her set up accounts such as CirrusMD . Member portal, Fullscript etc. Very nice women. Going through some rough times -death in family and multiple other things. Vanessa Orozco', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-10 10:21:06', '2025-01-10 11:01:45'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156489044', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000088254024', 'Juana Rincon Barrios', NULL, '1-10-25 Juana increased her income from $45K to $50K and chose a new plan since the Silver plan no longer makes sense with how the tax credit is applied.  So, she has her old plan for just the month of Jan. and a new plan for Feb. onward.

