  ('zcrm_1579374000156485068', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000015647211', 'Jacqueline Woodward', NULL, 'When I looked at this member when she came up on the Age Up list her spouse was already 50 +.  So they were put into the wrong pricing in the 2025 Zion Price Increase.  They were put into the 30-49 pricing ($780) when it should have been 50-64 ($1018) I will change in A123 &amp; notify member &amp; advisor', 'Patti Baron', 'Patti Baron', '2025-01-10 09:32:07', '2025-01-10 09:32:07'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156481063', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000154171002', 'Angela Allen', NULL, '1/10/25: Angela called wondering how to join welcome call. Let her know Vanessa would call her directly, but since the timing was so close, went ahead and transferred her. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-10 09:30:25', '2025-01-10 09:30:25'),
  ('zcrm_1579374000156481055', 'contact', 'zcrm_1579374000115302002', 'Todd Ebeling', NULL, '1/10/25: Tracey called wanting to know if a cologuard test is covered under her MEC. I explained that yes, it should be. The issue was possibly about provider and billing and wondering if they didn''t send it to the right place. I asked her to verify where the provider sent claim while I checked to verify her start date with ARM. She has an active date with ARM of 9/1/24, and there are no claims showing under their account. Advised Tracey to have the provider resend claim to ARM. Set FU for 1/17. Txt review link. AM', 'Concierge', 'Concierge', '2025-01-10 09:19:59', '2025-01-10 09:22:50'),
